<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Bible Kiyaka:</book>
  <para style="h">YOWANI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ywn</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yowani</para>
  <para style="toc1">Musamu wa Bukheti kásonika Yowani</para>
  <para style="mt2">Musamu kásonika Yowani</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yowani</para>
  <para style="imt">Khotidi ya mukanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wa Bukheti kásonika Yowani, básonikawa kikuma kya mangumba ma bakidisitu babana benina ku tsi ya Sidiya yina bakala tela hika ni Aziya dya khunda, bisi tela hika buthwena ni Tidiki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda wawu wenina yi mutindu wandi wuna bákyatikila malongi yi mihowu mina básonikinawa, biswaswani yi misamu mya bukheti myahika. Yandi kabati hana mupfunu wa lawu mu mana matadidini kimvidingingi kya ndinga yi mihangu mya Yesu.</para>
  <para style="io1">Ndambu yatheti ya mukanda (khaphu 1-12) yibati menika mambu ma mbuta tsambwadi matadidini Yesu. Mambu meni mana, bisima tela ni "bidimbu bya biphadi" kikuma mabati songila ni Yesu kenina Mwana wa Nzambi. Ndambu meni yayi yibati menika phi kutundakana kwa Yesu, mu mbandu hanga pfumu wa dibundu muyuta (khaphu 3), yi mukhetu wa ku Samadiya (khaphu 4), yi bambefu (khaphu 5 yi 9). Muna malongi mandi, Yesu kabati dimonikisa hanga dipha dina disi hana luzingu, muhungudi wuna wisi natisa batu kwena Tata Nzambi, yi mwini wuna wisi temuna tsi. Yesu kabati songila kwena batu boosu buna kenina yandi.</para>
  <para style="io1">Ndambu ya zodi ya mukanda (khaphu 13-21) yibati yidika yi kumenika tangwa dina "Yesu kafwana kukatuka ha tsi mu kukwenda kwena Tata wandi". Yesu kabati zonza kwena balonguki bandi, kabati baheka milongi kikuma kya tangwa dina kakalaku hika yi bawu (khaphu 13-16). Kunima Yesu wulombidini Nzambi Tata wandi, amana wumuhekini kiyeka kya balonguki bandi (khaphu 17).</para>
  <para style="ip">Meni dya mambu mana mazungi lufwa lwa Yesu (khaphu 18 yi 19) dyenina yi mambu ma lawu hakimosi yi mana ma Mathayi, Malaku yi Luka muna dilongi dimosi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kilumbu kya Phaki, Yesu wudisongidini wamoya kwena balonguki bandi (khaphu 20 yi 21). Amana musoniki wa Musamu wa Bukheti wawu kabati zimbula bwabu: kásonika mukanda wandi ndangu babana bámumonaku Yesu, bawu phi bakwikila mwena yandi (20:29-31).</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wa Bukheti kásonika Yowani wisi zonzila mbala za lawu Bayuta hanga kibuka kimosi kya kingenga. Nzonzidi yina yibati zonzila bambeni ba Yesu, mu kimvuka bapfumu ba mabundu babana bisi mutendisa. Yandi meni Yesu kenina Muyuta yi balonguki bandi batheti phi. Yowani tangwa kisi zonzila Bayuta, nzonzidi yandi yitadidiku dyambu dya tsi. Mana matadidi batu boosu babana bisi mutendisa Yesu Kidisitu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wa Bukheti wa Yowani wubatiku zonzila lubutuku lwa Yesu keti luyandiku lwa luzingu lwandi ku mesu ma batu. Kaasi muna khotidi ya kaleyi ya mukanda, kabati tendula ni "Yesu Kidisitu kenina Ndinga ya Nzambi", yina yisi kala hakimosi yi Nzambi tukidila matangwa moosu (1:1-18). Yesu, Ndinga ya Nzambi, wisa zingila hakimosi yi batu. Bwabuna batu bafwani bákitukila bana ba Nzambi. Muna luzingu lwandi lwa ha tsi, Yesu kenina mu kithwadi kya ngolu yi Tata. Yandi kenina "ngenzi wa Nzambi" mu tsi. Boosu babana bisi musanda Nzambi yi lungongu balenda muzayila mwena yandi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Ndinga ya mwini yi ya luzingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Muna luyandiku, Ndinga wádikadila amana Ndinga kákala hakimosi yi Nzambi; amana Ndinga kákala Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Yandi kákala muna luyandiku hakimosi yi Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Byosu, mwena yandi byáhangamina amana kweku kima kyáhangama konda yandi; muna byabina byisi monika; <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>mwena yandi mwákala luzingu. Amana luzingu lwákala mwini wa batu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Mwini wukenzudini muna phipha, kaasi phipha yálendaku mu kukwatawa. <verse eid="JHN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Hátula mutu mosi, bátuma kwena Nzambi, mu khumbu ya Yowani. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Kisa hanga mbangi, mu kuta kimbangi kitadidini mwini. Ndangu, mwena Yowani, boosu bakwikila. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Ka yandi ku wákala mwini, kaasi kyisa ta kimbangi kwena mwini. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Ndinga yákala mwini wakyedika, wuna wisi temuna mutu wosu, Ndinga yísa muna tsi.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Ndinga yákala muna tsi. Amana tsi yáhangama mwena yawu, kaasi tsi yámubakulaku. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Yísa kwena biwutu byandi, kaasi biwutu byandi bámutambwasaku. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Kaasi kwena boosu babana bámutambwasa, wábaheka hamu dya kukituka bana ba Nzambi; kwena babana bisi kwikila muna khumbu yandi. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Babana bábutukaku mu menga, keti mu luzolu lwa lutu, keti mu luzolu lwa mutu, kaasi mwena Nzambi.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Ndinga yákituka mutu, amana yisa zingila hana kati dya betu, amana betu twámona khembu yandi, khembu ya Mwana wa yakala yandi mosi wuna wábutukila mwena Tata; Ndinga yábasa yi khenda yi kyedika. <verse eid="JHN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Yowani wámutila kimbangi; kákalunga mu kuzimbula: «Kikuma kya yandi yízimbwala: "Wuna wubati kwisa ku manima ma meni, kenina mupfunu wa lawu kuluta meni, mukuma, wádikadila kedi ku thwala ya meni."» <verse eid="JHN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Kikuma, muna kuvula kwa kuvwa kwandi twátambwala, betu boosu, khenda hana thandu ya khenda. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Mukuma mitsiku myáhanama mwena Moyize; kaasi khenda yi kyedika byísila mwena Yesu Kidisitu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Heku mutu wámona kedi Nzambi; kaasi Mwana yandi mosi wenina Nzambi, yandi wisi nangina bela-bela yi Tata, yandi wámuzayikisa Tata.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimbangi kya Yowani Mubotiki kikuma kya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mth 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mlk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Tala kimbangi kya Yowani, tangwa bámutumina banganga Nzambi yi balefi kwena Bayuta tuka ku Yelusalemi, mu kumuhyula: «Ngeyi nani wenina?» <verse eid="JHN 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Wátambwasabwa, kátunabwoku, wátambwasa mu kuzimbula: «Meni yeku Kidisitu.» <verse eid="JHN 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Bámuhyula: «Amana nani wenina? Ngeyi wenina Diya?» Yowani wábavutwala: «Yeku phi yandi.» Bámuhyula: «Mbikudi wenina?» Wuzimbudini: «Loni», <verse eid="JHN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Hanga bamuzimbwadini: «Amana nati wenina? Ndangu twahana mvutu mosi kwena babana bátutuma! Biki wuzimbudini kikuma kya ngeyi meni?» <verse eid="JHN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Yowani wávutula: «Meni yenina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">"wuna wubati kalunga muna nganga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">sungikenu nzila kikuma kya Pfumu!"»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:23">– Bwabuna kázimbula mbikudi Yesaya<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yes 40:3. </char></note>. –<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Batu babana bátuma kwena bafwadisi mu kwenda mumona Yowani; <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>bamuhyudini: «Yuka ni weku Masiya, weku phi Diya, keti mbikudi, amana kikuma kya biki wubati botikila?» <verse eid="JHN 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Yowani wubavutwadini: «Meni, mbati lubotika mu mamba; hana kati dya benu henina yi mosi wuna luzayiku benu. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Kabati kwisa hana manima ma meni. Ndungiku mu kukutumuna misinga mya tsabatu zandi.» <verse eid="JHN 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Mamana moosu makala hitila ku Betaniya, kuna sambwa dikwawu dya Yolutani, kuna kakala botikila Yowani.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, Mwana wa mukoku wa Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Kilumbu kyálanda, Yowani wámona Yesu kukwisa kwena yandi, amana wuzimbudini: «Tala Mwana wa mukoku wa Nzambi wuna wisi katula masumu ma tsi. <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Kikuma kya yandi yízonzila tangwa yízimbula: "Mutu mosi wubati kwisa ku manima ma meni, kaasi kenina mupfunu kuluta meni, mukuma kakala dizingila kedi ku thwala ya meni." <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Yikalaku zaya keti nati káfwana kukala, kaasi ho yisa botika mu mamba ndangu yimuzayikisa kwena kanda dya Kiseledi.»<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Amana Yowani wáta kimbangi kyaki: «Mboni Kitembu kya Nzambi kukulunga tukila ku zilu hanga yembi amana wuzakadini hana thandu ya yandi. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Meni-meni yízayaku keti nati kákala, kaasi Nzambi, wuna wáthuma mu kubotika mu mamba, kánzimbwala: "Wamóna Kitembu kukulunga yi kuzakala hana thandu ya mutu mosi; yandi wuna wabótika mu Kitembu Kyatoma." <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Bwabuna mbonini meni-meni amana thini kimbangi ni mutu yandu kenina Mwana wa Nzambi.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balonguki batheti ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Kilumbu kyálanda, Yowani hana kákala hika, yi boodi ba balonguki bandi. <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Buna kámona Yesu wakala hita, wuzimbudini: «Tala Mwana wa mukoku wa Nzambi!» <verse eid="JHN 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Balonguki boodi babana báyuka ndinga zina, hanga balandi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Yesu wábaluka, wumoni ni bakala mulanda amana wubahyudini: «Biki lubati sanda?» Bawu bamuvutwadini: «Kubiki wisi zingila, Labuni?» -Disongidila: «Mulongi». - <verse eid="JHN 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Yandi wubazimbwadini: «Alwisa amana lwamóna.» Bénda amana bámona kuna kakala zingila; bánanga kilumbu mekina kwakuna, hakimosi yi yandi. Dyákala hanga tangwa dya kumi yi sambanu dya masikidika.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Andele, phangi wa yakala wa Simoni Phetelu, kákala mosi wa bodi babana báyuka ndinga za Yowani amana bálanda Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Mutu watheti katekila tundakana kákala phangi wandi Simoni; amana wumuzimbwadini: «Tumumoni Masiya.» -Disongidila «Kidisitu» - <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Wámunata Simoni yi kuna kákala Yesu. Yesu wámutala amana wuzimbudini: «Ngeyi wenina Simoni, mwana wa Yowani; bakutediki Sefwasi.» -Disongidila «Tadi». -<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fidiphu yi Natanayedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Kilumbu kyálanda, Yesu wázola ni kenda ku Ngadidi. Amana wátundakana Fidiphu, hanga wumuzimbwadini: «Ndanda!» <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Fidiphu kákala mwisi Betisayita, mbanza ya Andele yi Phetelu. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Fidiphu wátundakana Natanayedi amana wumuzimbwadini: «Tumumoni wuna bázonzila kwena Moyize yi muna Mitsiku yi bambikudi. Kenina Yesu mwisi Nazaleti, mwana wa Yozefu.» <verse eid="JHN 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Natanayedi wámuzimbwala: «Kuna Nazaleti, kufwani kwalubuka kima kya bukheti?» Fidiphu wumuzimbwadini: «Awisa amana wamóna»<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Yesu wámona Natanayedi mu kukwisa kwena yandi, hanga wumuzimbwadini kikuma kya yandi: «Tala mwisi Kiseledi wa kyedika; muna mwa yandi mweku bukamvi.» <verse eid="JHN 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Natanayedi wumuzimbwadini: «Ku biki wunzayidini?» Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Yikumoniki kedi tangwa wukadikini hana sina dya mufiki<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miti wa fiki</char></note>, hana Fidiphu khaku kakutela.» <verse eid="JHN 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Natanayedi wávutwakila: «Mulongi, ngeyi wenina Mwana wa Nzambi, ngeyi wenina kyamvu wa Kiseledi!» <verse eid="JHN 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Wukhwikidini kikuma kya buna yikuzimbwadini ni yikumoniki muna sina dya mufiki? Wamóna hika mambu ma mbuta-mbuta kuluta mama.» <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>Hanga wumuzimbwadini: «Kyedika, kyedika yibatibwa luzimbwala: lwamóna zilu dyakanguka amana banzyo ba Nzambi kutombuka yi kukulunga hana thandu ya Mwana wa mutu!»<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Longu lwa ku Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Muna kilumbu kya tatu, mukinzi wa longu wákala kuna Kana, muna kinzunga kya Ngadidi. Ngudi wa Yesu hana kákala, <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Yesu phi bámutedisa kuna longu meni luna hakimosi yi balonguki bandi. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Amana bwosu dyákonda vinu, muna tangwa dimosi, hanga ngudi wa Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Beku hika yi vinu.» <verse eid="JHN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Ngudi, biki ngeyi yi meni mu mambu mama? Tangwa dyama khaniku kedi dilungila.» <verse eid="JHN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Ngudi wandi wuzimbudini kwena basadi: «Hangenu kyosu kina kalúzimbwala.» <verse eid="JHN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Hákala hahana yi mindungu sambanu mya tuma myákala kikuma kya kudisemisa kwa Bayuta. Kosu mundungu yakala kota kitesu kya milangi khama. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Basisenu mindungu myami yi mamba.» Babasisimya yi hana thandu. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Buthwena, tékunenu amana natenumoku kwena muyidiki wa mukinzi.» Amana bawu bámunatinama. <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Tangwa káyedika, muyidiki wa mukinzi, mamba mákituka vinu, kázayaku kubiki dyátuka vinu meni dina. Kaasi basadi babana bálongulula mamba bázayabwa. Muyidiki wa mukinzi wámutela yakala wuna wákwela <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>amana wumuzimbwadini: «Mutu wosu kisi tekila hana vinu dya bukheti, yuka batu bazedini, wuhani nana mulala. Ngeyi wuswekiki vinu dya bukheti yi buthwena bwabu!»<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Luna lwákala luyandiku lwa bidimbu bya biphadi bya Yesu. Kásadilakya kuna mbanza ya Kana dya Ngadidi; wásongila khembu yandi, amana balonguki bandi bákwikila mwena yandi. <verse eid="JHN 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Kunima dya bwabuna, wákulunga ku mbanza ya Kafadinawumi yi ngudi wandi yi baphangi bandi yi balonguki bandi. Amana bilumbu bya khunda lwesi bánangakwa.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu muna nzu ya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mth 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mlk 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Mukinzi wa Phaki ya Bayuta wábwesuka amana Yesu wátombuka ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Kuna nzu ya Nzambi, káwana bateki ba bangombi, ba mikoku yi ba mayembi; yi bakwa tsyenzya bákala basikuka. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Kahanga wuyidiki fimbu dya misinga amana wábakukwasa boosu kuna phenza ya kyanzala kya nzu ya Nzambi, yi mikoku yi bangombi; wámwanga makuta ma bakwa tsyenza, wázanga phi mesa ma bawu; <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>hanga wuzimbudini kwena babana bakala tekisa mayembi: «Katulenu byabina byosu haka! Lukitulaku Nzu ya Tata wama hanga nzu yimosi ya kikhita!» <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Balonguki bandi báyubuka ni básonika bwabu: «Kitya kya lawu kina yenina kyawu kikuma kya Nzu yaku, kyanzínisa.»<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Bayuta bámuzimbwala: «Khi kidimbu wutusongidini mu kuhanga bwabuna?» <verse eid="JHN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Yesu wábavutwala: «Mwangenu nzu ya Nzambi yayi, amana mu bilumbu bitatu yitúngululaya.» <verse eid="JHN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Bayuta bamuzimbwadini: «Kwáfwana mvula makumaya yi sambanu mu kutunga nzu ya Nzambi yayi, amana ngeyi, mu bilumbu bitatu, watúngululaya?» <verse eid="JHN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Kaasi nzu ya Nzambi yina kakala zonzila yandi yákala lutu lwandi. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Amana tangwa káfutumuka ku bafwa, balonguki bandi báyubuka ni wázimbulabwa bwabuna; amana bákwikila mu Masonuku yi ndinga yina kázimbula Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuzayi bukheti mbundu ya mutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Buna kákala Yesu ku Yelusalemi, kuna mukinzi wa Phaki, balawu bákwikila mu khumbu yandi, mu kumona bidimbu bya biphadi bina kakala hanga. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Kaasi Yesu, yandi, kákwikilaku mwena bawu, kikuma wábazaya boosu. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Kákalaku phi yi mupfunu ni bamutila kimbangi kya mutu, mukuma yandi meni wázaya mana mákala mwena mutu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi Nikundimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Mutu mosi wákala muna mukanzu wa Bafwadisi khumbu yandi Nikundimu, kákala phi mosi hana kati dya bapfumu ba Bayuta. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Wisa muwana Yesu muna phipha yimosi, amana wumuzimbwadini: «Mulongi, tuzayi ni Nzambi wákutuma ndangu wisa tulonga; mukuma ka mutu ku wufwani mu kuhanga bidimbu bya biphadi bwosu wisibya hanga ngeyi, yuka ni Nzambi keku hakimosi yi yandi.» <verse eid="JHN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Yesu wámuvutwala: «Mu kyedika, yikuzimbwadibwa: ka mutu ku walenda mona Kipfumu kya Nzambi yuka ni kabutukiku lubutuku lwa pha.» <verse eid="JHN 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nikundimu wámuhyula: «Khi phila, mutu yandu wukodi kedi kafwani mu kubutuka hika mbala yikwawu? Wufwani hika ni kavutuka mu kundu dya ngudi wandi, amana kabutuka hika mbala ya zodi?» <verse eid="JHN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Kyedika, kyedika, yikuzimbwadibwa: yuka ni mutu kabutukiku mu mamba yi mu Kitembu, kafwaniku mu kukota mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Kina kibutukidini mu kimutu, kyenina kya kimutu; amana kina kibutukidini mu kitembu kyenina Kitembu. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>Yitukaku kikuma kya buna yikuzimbwadini: "Bulungi kwena benu ni lwabutuka mu mbala yikwawu." <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Muphephi wisi fula kuna wuzodini; wisiwa yuka, kaasi wazáyaku kuna wisi tuka yi kuna wisi kwenda. Phila mosi bwenina yi wuna wubutukini mu Kitembu.»<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nikundimu wumuhyudini: «Abweti bwalenda salamina bwabuna?» <verse eid="JHN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Ngeyi wenina mulongi mu Kiseledi, amana wuzayibwoku bwabuna? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Kyedika, kyedika, yikuzimbwadibwa: thwisi zonzila mana tuzayi, amana thwisi ta kimbangi kya mana tumoni, kaasi benu lwisiku tambwasa kimbangi kya betu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Yuka ni lubatiku khwikila tangwa mbati luzonzila mambu ma tsi; abweti lwakhwíkidila yuka ni yiluzonzila mambu ma ku zilu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Heku mutu watombuka kedi ku zilu, yuka ni ka wuna ku wakulunga ku zilu, Mwana wa mutu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna masonuku mahika mwenina ni </char><char style="fq" closed="false">wuna wákulumuka tukidila ku zilu, Mwana wa mutu wuna wenina muna Zilu. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">– Kikuma kya nzila ya muthu, kufwanikisa yi Nza 30:4; Lom 10:6.</char></note>! <verse eid="JHN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>Bwosu buna kátombula Moyize nyoka muna nganga, Mwana wa mutu phi bafweti mutombula bwabuna<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala muna Thl 21:9. </char></note>, <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>ndangu wosu wuna wukwikidini, katambula mwena yandi moyu wa mvula yi mvula. <verse eid="JHN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Mukuma Nzambi watoma zola tsi, wáhana Mwana wandi mosi, ndangu wosu wuna wukwikidini mwena yandi, katotaku kaasi katambula moya wa mvula yi mvula. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Kikuma Nzambi kátumaku Mwana wandi mu tsi kikuma kya kufundisa tsi, kaasi ndangu, muna nzila ya yandi, tsi yahuluka. <verse eid="JHN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Wuna wisi kwikila mwena yandi bamufundisaku; kaasi wuna wisiku kwikila, bamufundisi kedi, kikuma kakwikidiku mu zina dya Mwana mosi wa Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Amana tala pfundusu buna yenina: mwini wisa muna tsi, kaasi batu básangwala yi phipha kuluta mwini, kikuma miza mya bawu mya mbi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Mukuma wosu wuna wisi hanga mambu mambi wámenga mwini; yandi kisiku kwisa kwena mwini, hanga mihangu myandi myazayakana nana; <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>kaasi wuna wisi lemvuka ku kyedika, kisi kwisa kwena mwini, ndangu bwamonika ni mihangu myandi myisi hangama mu kimosi yi Nzambi.»<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi Yowani Mubotiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Kunima dya bwabuna, Yesu wisa mu mulambu wa Yuteya hakimosi yi balonguki bandi. Kwakuna, wánanga hakimosi yi bawu amana kakala botika<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala muna khaphu ya 4:1-2. </char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Yowani yandi phi kakala botika kuna Eno, bela-bela yi Sadimi, kikuma mamba ma lawu kwákala. Batu bakala kwenda kwakuna yi kutambulaka mbotika. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Hana Yowani khaku kedi kakota mu boloku<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala muna Mth 14:3; Mlk 6:17; Luk 3:19-20. </char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Hanga balonguki ba Yowani beka tendana yi Muyuta mosi kikuma kya dyambu ditadidini kudisemisa. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Benda kwena Yowani amana bámuzimbwala: «Mulongi, tala mutu wuna wukadiki yandi ku sambwa dikwawu dya Yolutani, wuna wátila ngeyi kimbangi, kabati botika amana batu boosu babati kwisa kwena yandi!» <verse eid="JHN 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Yowani wávutula: «Ka mutu ku wabonga kima kyahika yuka ni kimutukiku ku zilu. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Benu-benu lufwani mu kuthila kimbangi ni meni bwabu yízonza: "Meni yeku Kidisitu, kaasi ku thwala ya yandi báthuma<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala muna 1:20. Kufwanikisa yi Mal 3:1. </char></note>." <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Yandi wuvwini mukhetu wa longu, kenina mukwedi; kaasi nduku wa mukwedi wuna wenina hana kabeta, wubati muhinikina, kyesi kya lawu kisi kala kyawu mu kuyuka ndinga ya mukwedi; Bwabuna phi kyenina kyesi kyama, kyalungila kyenina. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Yambulenu yandi kaluma, meni yibetuka kwama.»<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wuna wutukini ku zilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>«Wuna wutukini ku zilu kenina hana thandu ya boosu; wuna wenina ha tsi kenina phi wa ha tsi, amana ndinga yandi phi yenina ya ha tsi. Wuna wutukini ku zilu kenina [ha thandu ya boosu]; <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>kisi ta kimbangi kya mamana kamonini yi mana kayukini, kaasi ka mutu ku wisikya tambwasa kimbangi kyandi. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Wuna wátambwasa kimbangi kyandi, kisi songila ni Nzambi kyedika kisi zonza. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Mukuma wuna katumi Nzambi, kisi zonza ndaka za Nzambi, kikuma kisi hana Kitembu kyakonda kitesu. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Tata kisi muzola Mwana; amana wásya moosu muna moku mandi. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Wuna wisi kwikila mwena Mwana, kenina yi luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula; wuna wakonda mulemvukila Mwana, kabongalwoku luzingu, kaasi khabu za Nzambi zenina yi yandi.»<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi Mukhetu wa ku Samadiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Yesu ha kázaya ni Bafwadisi báyuka mu kuzonzila ni yandi kákala kitula yi kubotika balonguki kuluta Yowani, <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>-kinga ka yandi meni ku Yesu wakala botika, kaasi balonguki bandi. - <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Yesu wákatuka ku kinzunga Yuteya amana wénda hika ku kinzunga Ngadidi. <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Kinga wáfwana kuhitila mu kinzunga kya Samadiya. <verse eid="JHN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Yesu wátula muna mbanza yimosi ya Samadiya, yina bakala tela ni Sikadi; yina yenina bela-bela yi kilanga kina káhana Yakobi kwena mwana wandi Yozefu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Hahana hákala yi tho ya mamba ya Yakobi. Bwosu kákala mu kitambu, Yesu wálembwa, amana wásikuka hana kabeta ka tho ya mamba. Yakala kitesu kya tangwa dya tsinzi.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Mukhetu mosi wa ku Samadiya wisa teka mamba. Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Pheka mamba yinwa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>-Kikuma balonguki bandi benda sumba bima bya kudya mu mbanza. - <verse eid="JHN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Mukhetu wa ku Samadiya wumuzimbwadini: «Abweti ni ngeyi wenina Muyuta, wufwani mu kulomba mamba ma kunwa, kwena meni yenina mukhetu wa ku Samadiya?» -Kikuma Bayuta bisiku zola kukhundakana kwena bisi Samadiya.- <verse eid="JHN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Wadi wázayaka kabu dya Nzambi, amana keti nani kenina wuna wubati kulomba mamba ma kunwa, wadi ngeyi wukhanima mulomba, amana yandi kakhani kuheka mamba ma luzingu.» <verse eid="JHN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Mukhetu wumuvutwadini: «A Pfumu, weku keti kilekwa kya kutekila, dibulu phi dya kaleyi. Abweti watékilama mamba meni mana ma luzingu? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Ngeyi wubanzi ni mbuta wenina, kuluta khaka wetu Yakobi, wuna wátuheka dibulu dya mamba dyadi; yandi meni phi wánwama yi bana bandi yi bibulu byandi?» <verse eid="JHN 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Yesu wámuvutwala: «Mutu wosu wanwa mamba mama, kihwinya kyamúkwata hika; <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>kaasi wuna wanwa mamba mana yimúheka meni, kihwinya kyalendaku mukwata hika: mamba mana yimúheka, mamúkitukila tho ya mamba mana makwata lubuka kikuma kya luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula.» <verse eid="JHN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Mukhetu wumuzimbwadini: «A Pfumu, pheka mamba meni mamana, ndangu khwataku hika kihwinya amana khalaku hika yi mupfunu wa kwisa teka mamba kwaku.»<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>-Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Ndawenda, mutela yakala dyaku amana awisa vutuka kwaku.» <verse eid="JHN 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Mukhetu wávutula: «Yeku yi yakala.» Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Mboti wuzonzini, ha wuzimbudini ni weku yi yakala; <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>mukuma wákala yi bayakala batanu, amana yandi wubati zinga yandi buthwena, keku yakala dyaku. Kyedika wuzonzini.» - <verse eid="JHN 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Mukhetu wumuzimbwadini: «A Pfumu, mboni ni ngeyi, mbikudi wenina. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Bakhaka betu báfukamina Nzambi ha mongu wawu, kaasi benu Bayuta lwisi zimbula ni kizika kilungini mu kufukamina Nzambi, ku Yelusalemi kyenina.» <verse eid="JHN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Khwikila, mukhetu, ni tangwa dyakwísa, dina dyakála ni Tata bamúfukaminaku hika ha mongu wawu keti ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Benu lwisi fukamina Nzambi wuna luzayiku; betu Bayuta thwisi fukamina wuna tuzayini, mukuma luhulusu, kwena Bayuta lwátuka. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Kaasi tangwa dyakwísa, dilungidi kedi, ndangu bafukamini ba kyedika bamúfukamina Tata mu kitembu yi mu kyedika; mukuma wawuna mutindu wa bafukamini bana kisi sanda Tata. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Nzambi kenina Kitembu, bulungi ni bana bisi mufukamina, bamufukamina mu kitembu yi mu kyedika.» <verse eid="JHN 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Mukhetu wa musamadiya wumuzimbwadini: «Nzayi ni Masiya wuna bisi tela Kidisitu, kabati kwisa. Tangwa kakwísa, yandi watúsamwana moosu.» <verse eid="JHN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Meni yandu yibati kuzonzisa.»<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, balonguki bandi bakala yituka mu kumona ni kabati yambila yi mukhetu mosi. Kaasi keti mosi wa bawu, wáfwana ni káhyula: «Biki wubati sanda?» kondilo «Kikuma kya biki wubati yambidila yi mukhetu?» <verse eid="JHN 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Amana mukhetu wásisa kalondu kandi, wenda mu mbanza amana wuzimbudini kwena batu: <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>«Alwisa tala! Mutu mosi wenina kuna, kánzimbwadini mambu moosu mana yíhanga. Yandi kafwaniku ni kakala Masiya?» <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Batu bálubuka mu mbanza amana bisa kwena Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, balonguki bakala muzimbwala: «Ah Mulongi, dya!». <verse eid="JHN 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Kaasi yandi wubavutwadini: «Meni yenina yi bima bya kudya, bina lukondi zaya benu.» <verse eid="JHN 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Balonguki bakala dihyula bawu yi bawu: «Henina yi mutu wumunatini kima kya kudya?» <verse eid="JHN 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Madya mama menina mu kuhanga luzolu lwa wuna wáthuma yi mu kumanisa kisalu kyandi. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Benu lwisiku zonza bwabu: "Ngonda ya zisadi mu kukatula mbongu?" Kaasi meni yiluzimbwadini: vumbulenu mesu amana talenu bilanga, bibundu bibengi amana tangwa dya kuhelabya difwani! <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Wuna wisi katula mbongu, lufutu kisi tambula; amana kisi hela bibundu kikuma kya luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula; ndangu ni wuna wisi kuna yi wuna wisi hela, babodi basephila hakimosi. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Mukuma, kingana kina kya kyedika kyisi zimbula: "Mutu mosi wisi kuna amana mukwawu wendi hela." <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Meni yílutuma mu kuhela mbongu muna lwakonda monina phasi; batu bahika bámona phasi amana benu lubati zingila muna bisalu bya bawu.»<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Bisi Samadiya balawu ba mbanza meni yina bákwikila mwena Yesu, kikuma kya kimbangi kina kya mukhetu: «Kánzimbwala moosu mana yíhanga.» <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Buna bátula bela-bela yi yandi, bisi Samadiya bámulomba ni kazakala ndambu yi bawu; bilumbu byodi kánanga kwakuna. <verse eid="JHN 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Batu balawu-lawu hika bákwikila kikuma kya ndinga yandi; <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>amana bázimbula kwena mukhetu: «Heku ni kikuma kya mambu mana wutuzimbwadikini tukwikididi; mukuma tumuyukini betu-betu yi matu metu, tukwikidi phi ni yandi kenina kyedika muhuludi wa tsi.»<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubukini Mwana wa Pfumu mosi wa ku nganda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Kunima dya bilumbu byodi meni bina, Yesu wákatuka hahana, wenda ku Ngadidi. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Mukuma yandi meni Yesu kata kimbangi: «Mbikudi kisiku lumina ku tsi yandi.» <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Tangwa kisa ku Ngadidi, bisi Ngadidi bámuyamba mboti-mboti, kikuma bámona moosu mana kásala kuna Yelusalemi, muna tangwa dya mukinzi, mukuma bawu meni kuna benda kuna mukinzi meni wuna<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mth 8:5-13; Luk 7:1-10</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Yesu wávutuka hika ku mbanza ya Kana dya Ngadidi, kuna kábalula mamba mu vinu. Pfumu mosi wa ku nganda ya kyamvu wavwa mwana wandi wa yakala wákala wabela kuna Kafadinawumi. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Buna káyuka ni Yesu wutudini mu Ngadidi ha kátuka ku kinzunga kya Yuteya, wenda kwena yandi amana wámulomba ni kakulumuka ndangu kamukodisa mwana wandi wuna wákala mu kulakana, kuna Kafadinawumi. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Benu, lwalendaku kwikila yukani khaku lumona bidimbu bya biphadi yi bithondu!» <verse eid="JHN 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Pfumu wa ku nganda wumuzimbwadini: «A Pfumu, kulumuka ku nzu, thwénda, buna khaku kedi kafwa mwana wama.» <verse eid="JHN 4:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Awenda kwaku, mwana waku moya kenina.» Mutu wuna wákwikila muna ndinga yina kámuzimbwala Yesu amana wenda. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Buna kakala kulumuka, basadi bandi bisa mulanda ndangu bamuzimbwala: «Mwana waku moya kenina.» <verse eid="JHN 4:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Hanga wubahyudini keti khi tangwa, mwana wandi kádiyuka; bawu bamuvutwadini: «Mukolu, muna tangwa dya theti dya masikidika, yimumanisikini mbawu ya mu lutu.» <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Tata wázaya kwandi ni muna tangwa meni dina, mwamuna kamuzimbwadikini Yesu: «Mwana waku moya kenina.» Amana wákituka mukwikidi yandi yi nzu yandi yosu. <verse eid="JHN 4:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Kina kyákala kidimbu kya kiphadi kya zodi káhanga Yesu, ha kátuka ku kinzunga kya Yuteya mu kukwisa ku Ngadidi.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubeludi mukwa khonzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Kunima dya bwabuna, Bayuta bata mukinzi wumosi amana Yesu wátombuka kuna Yelusalemi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Kinga, kuna Yelusalemi kwákala yi kiziba kimosi bela-bela yi mwelu wa Mikoku, amana kyákala yi mbalanda tanu; mu ndinga ya hebelu bisikya tela ni Betizata. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Muna mbalanda meni zazina, mulumba-lumba wa bambefu bákala hahana: baphofu, bitingwa yi bikhumbwa, [bakala hingila kuvuyuka kwa mamba. <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Mukuma wanzyo mosi wa Pfumu wakala luta muna matangwa mamosi muna kiziba yi kuvuyaka mamba. Mbefu wuna watheti wákala didibula bwabuna mávuyuka mamba kakala beluka ku maladi mandi, keti bweti menina maladi mana.] <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Hákala yi mutu mosi wánanga yi maladi mvula makumatatu yi nana. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Tangwa kámumona Yesu bwabuna walandalala amana wázaya ni yandi mutu wuzingi lawu mu maladi, hanga wumuhyudini: «Wuzodini ni wabeluka?» <verse eid="JHN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Mbefu wumuvutwadini: «Pfumu, yeku yi mutu wandíbula mu kiziba tangwa mabati vuyuka mamba; buna yimeka ni yididibula, mutu wahika wundutini.» <verse eid="JHN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Telama, bonga kiphoyu kyaku amana kangala.» <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Muna mbala mosi, mutu wábeluka; wábonga kiphoyu kyandi amana wáyandika mu kukangala. Kinga, kyákala kilumbu kya sabata, <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>amana bapfumu ba Bayuta bázimbula kwena mutu wuna wábeluka: «Lelu, kilumbu kya sabata, weku yi muswa wa kutikula kiphoyu kyaku.» <verse eid="JHN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Yandi wubavutwadini: «Mutu wuna wumbeludini, kanzimbwadini: "Bonga kiphoyu kyaku amana kangala."» <verse eid="JHN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Hanga bamuhyudini: «Nati kenina wuna wukuzimbwadikini: "Bonga kiphoyu kyaku amana kangala?"» <verse eid="JHN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Kaasi mutu wuna wábeluka, kázayaku keti nati kákala; mukuma Yesu wátota mu vuya dya mulumba-lumba wa batu bana bákala hahana.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Kunima dya bwabuna, Yesu wámutundakana muna nzu ya Nzambi amana wumuzimbwadini: «Tala buna wubelukini, buthwena bwabu; wusumukaku hika ndangu wubwilaku dyambu dya mbi diluti kitesu.» <verse eid="JHN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Mutu wuna wenda zimbula kwena Bayuta ni Yesu wámubela. <verse eid="JHN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Hanga Bayuta beka sanda ni bamuhanga mbi Yesu, kikuma mu kilumbu kya sabata káhanga mambu mana. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Kaasi Yesu wábazimbwala: «Tata wama mu kisalu kenina yi hadyena dyadi; meni phi mu kisalu yenina.» <verse eid="JHN 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Kikuma kya ndinga meni yina, bapfumu ba bayuta báyandikila mu kusanda phila ya kumuhondisila Yesu. Hákalaku lwesi ni kikuma kya buna kakonda zitisa kilumbu kya sabata, kaasi kikuma wázimbula hika ni Nzambi kenina Tata wandi wakyedika, hanga bwabuna wekadikhukisa yi Nzambi.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hamu dya Mwana wa Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Hanga Yesu wubavutwadini: «Mu kyedika, kyedika yiluzimbwadini, mena kyedika: Mwana kafwaniku ni kadihangila kima yandi meni; kisi hanga kaka kina kamoni kwena Tata wandi. Kikuma kyosu kina kisi hanga Tata, Mwana wandi phi kyakina kisi hanga muna mbandu yimosi. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Mukuma Tata kisi zola mwana amana kisi musongila kima kyosu kina kisi hanga yandi meni. Kamúsongila hika mambu ma lawu ma mbuta kuluta, ndangu maluyitwakisa. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Kikuma, bwosu kisi futumuna, Tata, bamvumbi amana wubahekini luzingu, yi bwabuna phi Mwana kisi hana luzingu kwena wuna kazodini. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Amana Tata kisiku fundisa mutu, kaasi pfundusu yosu wáhanaya kwena Mwana, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>ndangu batu boosu bamuzitisa Mwana bwosu bisi muzitisa Tata. Wuna wakonda zitisa Mwana, kazitisiku phi Tata wuna wámutuma.<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>«Mu kyedika, kyedika yiluzimbwadini: Wuna wisi yuka ndinga yama, wisi kwikila phi mwena wuna wáthuma, kenina yi luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula. Kahítaku ku pfundusu, kaasi yandi, wuhyiti kedi tukidila ku lufwa yi kuna luzingu. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Mu kyedika, kyedika yiluzimbwadini: tangwa dyisi kedi, yi dyadidi phi dina bayúkila bamvumbi ndinga ya Mwana wa Nzambi; amana bana bayúkaya, bazínga. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Kikuma, bwosu buna kenina Tata yi luzingu mwena yandi-meni, bwabuna phi káhana muswa kwena Mwana ndangu kakala yi luzingu mwena yandi meni. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Amana wámuheka hamu dya kufundisa, kikuma yandi kenina Mwana wa mutu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>Buluyitukisaku, mukuma tangwa dibati kwisa dina bayúkila, boosu bana benina mu mazyamu, ndinga yandi <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>amana balúbuka mu mazyamu ma bawu. Babana bakala hanga mambu ma bukheti, balúbuka kikuma kya lufutumuku lwa luzingu, kaasi babana bakala hanga mambu mambi bafútumuka kikuma kya lufutumuku lwa pfundusu. <verse eid="JHN 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>Meni yihangaku kima kimosi mu meni-meni. Yisi fundisa bwosu buna ngyukidini, amana pfundusu ya meni yenina ya masonga, kikuma yisiku sanda mu kuhanga luzolu lwama, kaasi luzolu lwa wuna wáthuma.»<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimbangi kikuma kya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>«Yuka ni yiditila kimbangi meni-meni, kimbangi kyama, kyeku kya kyedika. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Henina yi mutu wahika wisi ta kimbangi kikuma kya meni, amana nzayi ni kimbangi kina kabati thila, kya kyedika kyenina. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>Benu lwátuma bambambala kwena Yowani, yandi phi kimbangi kitadidini kyedika káta. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Kikuma kya meni, kimbangi yisikyoku hingila kwena batu; kaasi yisi zonza bwabuna, ndangu benu lwahuluka. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Yowani kákala mwinda wuna wubati lema amana wukyenzudini, amana benu lwátambwasa mu kusephila ku kikhya kyandi mu tangwa dimosi. <verse eid="JHN 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>Meni yenina yi kimbangi kyambuta kuluta kina kya Yowani: kikuma mihangu mina kápheka Tata mu kulungisa, mihangu meni mina mbati hanga, myamina mibati thila kimbangi mu kusongila ni Tata wáthuma. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>Amana Tata wuna wáthuma, yandi-meni phi wáthila kimbangi. Benu khaku kedi luyuka ndinga yandi, keti kumona mbunzu yandi. <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>Amana ndinga yandi yisiku zingila mwena benu, kikuma lwisiku kwikila mwena wuna kátuma yandi. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Lwisi longuka Masonuku yi masingitini, kikuma lwisi banza ni mwamuna lwatámbwala luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula: kinga mamana misi thila kimbangi. <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Kaasi benu lwisiku zola ni lwisa kwena meni ndangu lwatambula luzingu.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>«Khembu yisiyoku tambwala kwena batu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Kaasi yiluzayi ni lweku yi lungongu lwa Nzambi muna mbundu zenu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Meni yisidi mu khumbu ya Tata wama, amana benu lubwisi mu kuthambula. Yuka ni mutu wahika kisa mu khumbu ya yandi-meni, benu lwamútambula. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Abweti lwakwíkidila benu lwisi tambula khembu yenu mwena benu yi benu, kaasi khembu yina yisi tuka kwena yandi mosi Nzambi, lwisiyoku sanda? <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Lubanzaku ni meni yilúfunda kwena Tata. Mutu wulufundini Moyize, mwena wuna lwásila kivuvu kyenu. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Kikuma, wadi ni lwámukwikilaka Moyize, wadi luka khwikila meni phi, mukuma yandi, kikuma kya meni kásonikina. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Kaasi yuka ni lwisimoku kwikila masonuku mandi, abweti lwakwíkidilaza ndaka zama?»<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudisini batu mafunda matanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mth 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Kunima dya bwabuna, Yesu wenda ku sambwa dikwawu dya yanga dya mbuta dya Ngadidi dina bisi tela hika ni yanga dya mbuta dya Tibediyadi. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Mulumba-lumba wa batu balawu bakala mulanda, kikuma batu bakala mona bidimbu bya biphadi bina kakala sala kwena bambefu. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Yesu wátombuka ku mongu amana wázakala kwakuna hakimosi yi balonguki bandi. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Kinga Phaki, mukinzi wa Bayuta, yábwesuka. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Yesu wáthuta mesu amana wumoni mulumba-lumba wa batu balawu bakala kwisisa kuna kákala yandi; hanga wuhyudi kwena Fidiphu: «Kubiki tufwani kusumbila mapha kikuma kya batu baba ndangu badya?» <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>-Kázimbula bwabuna ndangu kamuleya, mukuma yandi-meni wázaya kima káfwana mu kahanga. - <verse eid="JHN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Fidiphu wumuvutwadini: «Ketibwe tusumbi kwetu mapha ma phata<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Phata zazi bakalaza tela ni "dinadiyo". Dinadiyo dimosi dyákala lufutu lwa musadi wa bilanga mosi muna kilumbu. Khama zodi za dinadiyo zákala lufutu lwa batu khama zodi muna kilumbu. </char></note> khama zodi, malungilaku ndangu mutu wosu kadya keti koma ka kima.» <verse eid="JHN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Mosi wa balonguki bandi, Andele, phangi wa yakala wa Simoni Phetelu, wumuzimbwadini: <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>«Tala mwana yakala mosi wenina yi mapha ma odizi<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Odizi yenina mbandu ya ngenza zafwanana yi bule. Batu bana bakonda yi kuvwa kwalawu, bawu bisiza dya.</char></note> matanu yi batsema bodi. Kaasi biki twahángilama yi lawu dya batu baba?» <verse eid="JHN 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Yesu wuzimbudini: «Bazakadisenu batu meni babana.» Mwangu walawu wákala homa meni hana. Hanga bamani zakala; kitesu kya mafunda matanu ma bayakala. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Yesu wábonga mapha, wávutula matondu kwena Nzambi, amana wákabisama kwena babana bákala hana; wákabisa phi bwabuna batsema, bwosu buna bázola. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Buna báyukuta, Yesu wázimbula kwena balonguki bandi: «Tongunenu bitini bina bisadini, ndangu keti kima kizanganaku.» <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Bátongunabya phi; bábasisa bitunga kumi yi byodi bya bitini bya mapha matanu ma odizi, bina básisa babana badya. <verse eid="JHN 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Mu kumona kiphadi kina káhanga, batu bekina zimbula: «Mu kyedika ni yandi kenina Mbikudi wuna wakwísa mu tsi!» <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Yesu wázaya ni bazodi bamukitula kyamvu mu ngolu, kahanga wuyekuki hika ku mongu, yandi hika.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukangadi ha thandu ya yanga dya mbuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mth 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mlk 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Ha mabwa masikidika, balonguki bandi bákulunga yi kuna yanga dya mbuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>Bákota mu masuwa mamosi ndangu benda ku Kaphedinawumi, kuna sambwa dikwawu dya yanga dya mbuta. Hana phipha yibwi kedi, amana Yesu hana khaku kedi katula kuna bákala bawu, <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>amana mamba ma yanga dya mbuta makala ningana lawu, kikuma pfunzi yimosi yakala tukula ngolu. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Kunima dya kutika kitesu kya kilometele matanu keti masambanu, bamumoni Yesu kabati kangala hana thandu ya yanga dya mbuta amana wábwesuka kuna masuwa; bweya bwábakwata. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Kaasi wubazimbwadini: «Meni yandu, luyukaku bweya.» <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Bázola ni bamukotisa mu masuwa, kaasi muna tangwa meni dina, masuwa mátula mu mafu ma sabu dina bakala kwendisa.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mulumba-lumba wa batu wusandi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Kilumbu kyálanda, mulumba-lumba wa batu wuna wásala ku sambwa dina dikwawu dya yanga dya mbuta, wumoni ni masuwa mamosi lwesi mákala hana; amana bázaya ni Yesu kákotaku hakimosi yi balonguki bandi, kaasi balonguki benda bawu hika. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Kaasi masuwa makwawu ku Tibediyadi mátuka, bela-bela yi homa hana bádila mapha kunima dya kulombila kwa Pfumu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Mulumba-lumba wa batu, tangwa bámona ni keti Yesu, keti balonguki bandi bákalahoku, batu bákota bawu-meni mu masuwa amana benda ku Kaphedinawumi mu kusanda Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, dipha dya luzingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Bámuwana Yesu kuna sambwa dikwawu dya yanga dya mbuta amana bamuzimbwadini: «Mulongi, khi tangwa wutudini kwaku?» <verse eid="JHN 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Yesu wábavutwala: «Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadini, lubati tsanda, heku ni kikuma kya bidimbu bya biphadi bina lumonikini, kaasi kikuma kya mapha mana ludikini yi buna luyukutikini. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Lusalakaku kikuma kya madya mana misi vunda, kaasi kikuma kya madya mana misi nanga kikuma kya luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula. Mana kalúheka Mwana wa mutu, mukuma yandi wuna basya kidimbu kya kipfumu kwena Tata Nzambi.» <verse eid="JHN 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Bawu bamuzimbwadini: «Biki tufwani mu kuhanga ndangu twalungisa mihangu mya Nzambi?» <verse eid="JHN 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Yesu wábavutwala: «Muhangu wa Nzambi wulombini ni lwasya lukwikilu lwenu mwena wuna kátuma yandi meni.» <verse eid="JHN 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Hanga bamuzimbwadi hika: «Amana ngeyi, khi kyawu kidimbu kya kiphadi kina wusadini, ndangu twamona amana twakukwikila? Khi muhangu wuhangini? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Batata betu badya maana muna nganga, bwosu buna básonika: "Wábaheka madya mana mátuka ku zilu."» <verse eid="JHN 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Yesu wábazimbwala: «Mu kyedika, kyedika, yibati luzimbwala, heku ni Moyize wáluheka dipha dyátuka ku zilu; Tata wama wuna wisi luheka dipha dya kyedika dyátuka ku zilu. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Mukuma, dipha dya Nzambi dyenina dina ditukini ku zilu kikuma kya kuhana luzingu mu tsi.» <verse eid="JHN 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Bámuzimbwala: «Pfumu, tuhekaka dipha meni dina kosu tangwa.»<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Yesu wábazimbwala: «Meni yenina dipha dya luzingu. Wuna wisini kwena meni, kayúkaku hika nzala, amana wuna wukwikidini mwena meni kayúkaku hika kihwinya keti mbala mosi. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Kaasi yiluzimbwadikibwa: lumbonikini, amana lwisiku kwikila kwenu. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Kosu mutu wuna kaphekini Tata wama, kakwísa kwena meni. Amana wuna wisini kwena meni, yilendaku mukukwasa ku phenza keti mbala mosi; <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>mukuma ku zilu thukini, heku ni kikuma kya kusala luzolu lwama, kaasi luzolu lwa wuna wáthuma. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Kinga, luzolu lwa wuna wáthuma lwenina ni thotisaku keti mosi muna boosu bana kápheka, kaasi yibafutumuna mu kilumbu kya tsuka. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Kikuma luzolu lwa Tata wama lwenina ni wosu wuna wumoni Mwana amana wusini lukwikilu lwandi mwena yandi, katambula luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula; amana meni yimúfutumuna mu kilumbu kya tsuka.»<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Hanga Bayuta bekabokuta kikuma kya yandi, kikuma wázonza bwabu: «Meni yenina dipha dyátuka ku zilu.» <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Bakala zimbula: «Ka yandi ku, Yesu, mwana wa Yozefu, yandu tuzayini tata yi ngudi wandi? Abweti kafwani kuzimbula buthwena ni ku zilu kátuka?» <verse eid="JHN 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Yesu wábavutwala: «Lubokutaku benu yi benu. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Heku mutu wufwani mu kukwisa kwena meni yuka ni Tata wuna wáthuma kamunatiku, amana meni yimúfutumuna mu kilumbu kya tsuka. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Muna mikanda mya bambikudi, básonika bwabu: "Boosu babálonga kwena Nzambi." Wosu wuna wáyuka malongi ma Tata wisi kwena meni. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Heku mutu wámumona kedi Tata; yuka ni ka wuna ku wátuka kwena Nzambi; yandi wámumona Tata. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Mu kyedika, kyedika, yiluzimbwadini: wuna wisi kwikila, kenina yi luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Meni yenina dipha dya luzingu. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Batata benu badya maana muna nganga, amana bafwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Kaasi dipha dyadi, dyadina ditukini ku zilu, ndangu wuna wisidya dya kafwáku. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Meni yenina dipha dya luzingu dina dyátuka ku zilu. Yuka ni mutu kadya dipha meni dina, kazínga mvula yi mvula. Dipha dina yihána meni, dyenina lutu lwama, kikuma kya luzingu lwa ha tsi.»<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Bayuta bakala tendana bawu yi bawu yi kuzimbulaka: «Abweti mutu yandu kafwani ni katuheka lutu lwandi mu kudya?» <verse eid="JHN 6:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Kyedika, kyedika, yibati luzimbwala, yuka ni ludiku lutu lwa Mwana wa mutu, lunwiku phi menga mandi, lweku yi luzingu mwena benu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Wuna wisi dya lutu lwama amana kisi nwa phi menga mama, kenina yi luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula amana meni yimúfutumuna mu kilumbu kya tsuka. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Mukuma lutu lwama lwenina madya ma kyedika; menga mama phi menina malafu ma kyedika. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Wuna wisi dya lutu lwama, wisi nwa phi menga mama kisi zingila mwena meni, meni phi mwena yandi. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Bwosu kenina mu luzingu Tata wuna wáthuma; amana bwosu buna yisi zingila meni mwena Tata, bwabuna phi wuna wisi ndya, kazíngila mwena meni. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Dyadi yi dipha dina ditukini ku zilu. Dyeku hanga dina badya batata; boosu bafwa. Wuna wisi dya dipha dyadi kazínga mvula yi mvula.» <verse eid="JHN 6:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Tala mana kázimbula muna nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta, tangwa kakala longa kuna Kafadinawumi.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndinga za luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Kunima dya kuyuka malongi ma Yesu, balonguki bandi lawu bazimbudini: «Ndinga yina ngolu yenina; nani wufwani mu kumuyukila?»<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Yesu bwosu kázaya ni balonguki bandi bákala bokuta kikuma kya mambu mana, hanga wuzimbudini: «Mambu mama mekina kisinza kikuma kya benu? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Amana yuka ni lwamona Mwana wa mutu kutombuka kuna kákala theti? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Kitembu wisi hana luzingu. Lutu lwisiku hanga kima. Ndinga zina yiluzimbwadini meni zenina Kitembu yi luzingu. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Kaasi hana kati dya benu henina yi ndambu ya batu bana bakondi kwikila.» Mukuma, tukidila ku luyandiku, Yesu wázaya banati bakala bana bakalaku kwikila yi wuna wakhana mulambula. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Amana kakala zimbula: «Yihahana yiluzimbwadiki ni heku mutu fwani kisa kwena meni, yuka ni Tata kamusendibwoku.»<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Tukila bwabuna, balonguki bandi, balawu bávutuka kwabawu; bakalaku mulanda hika. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Amana Yesu wuzimbudini kwena bawu kumi yi bodi: «Benu phi luzodi ni lwenda?» <verse eid="JHN 6:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simoni Phetelu wumuvutwadini: «Pfumu, kwena nani twakwenda? Ngeyi wenina yi ndaka za luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Buthwena tukwikidini, tuzayi ni ngeyi wenina Watoma wa Nzambi.» <verse eid="JHN 6:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Yesu wábavutwala: «Ka meni ku yílusola benu kumi yi bodi? Kinga mosi wa benu kiphidi-mutu kenina!» <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Yutasi, kakala zonzila, mwana wa Simoni Sikadyoti, mukuma yandi wakwisa mulambula, yandi mosi wa bawu kumi yi bodi.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Baphangi ba Yesu bakwikidiku mwena yandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Kunima dya bwabuna, Yesu kakala kangala muna kinzunga kya Ngadidi kyosu; kikuma kázolaku hika ni kakangala mu kinzunga kya Yuteya, kikuma Bayuta bakala musanda ni bamuhonda. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Kinga mukinzi wa Bayuta wuna wa Masaka wábwesuka. <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>Baphangi ba Yesu bamuzimbwadini: «Katuka kwaku amana wenda ku kinzunga kya Yuteya, ndangu balonguki baku bamona bisalu bina wubati sala ngeyi. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Heku mutu wisi sala mu kitsweki, yuka ni zodi batu boosu bamuzaya. Mukuma myamina mihangu wisi hanga, dimonikisa kwena batu ba tsi.» <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Kikuma, keti baphangi bandi bakalaku kwikila mwena yandi. <verse eid="JHN 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Hanga Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Tangwa dyama khaku kedi dilungila; kaasi tangwa dina dya benu dyalungila disi kaka kosu kilumbu. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Tsi fwaniku yalumenga, meni yisi mbenga kikuma mbati ta kimbangi kyandi ni mihangu myandi mya mbi myenina. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Benu alwenda ku mukinzi, meni yikwéndakwoku kuna mukinzi meni wuna, kikuma tangwa dyama khaku kedi difwana.» <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Kunima dya kuzimbula bwabuna, yandi wásala kwandi ku kinzunga kya Ngadidi.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ku mukinzi wa Masombolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Kaasi tangwa benda baphangi bandi ku mukinzi, hanga yandi phi wátombuka kwakuna, ka mu kudimonikisa ku kaasi mu kitsweki. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Bayuta bakala musanda muna tangwa dya mukinzi amana bakala zimbula: «Kubiki kenina yandina?» <verse eid="JHN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Pfweta-pfweta lawu zákala muna milumba-lumba mya batu kikuma kya yandi. Bahika bakala zimbula: «Mutu mosi wabukheti», bakwawu bakala zimbula: «Loni, mulumba-lumba wa batu kabati lobula.» <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Hákalaku keti mutu wáfwana kazonza wengele mu mambu matadidini yandi kikuma kya bweya bwa Bayuta.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Hana mukinzi wekina ha kati-kati, tangwa kisa kota Yesu mu nzu ya Nzambi amana weka longa. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Bayuta báyituka lawu, amana bakala dihyula: «Abweti kazayidi Masonuku yandi mutu wakondama longuka?»<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Yesu wábavutwala: «Malongi mama matukiku kwena meni-meni, kaasi kwena wuna wáthuma matukini. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Ho mutu wuzodi kusala luzolu lwandi, kazáya yuka ni malongi mama, kwena Nzambi mabati tuka ho meni-meni yibati dizonzila. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Wuna wisi dizonzila yandi-meni, khembu yandi kisi sanda. Kaasi wuna wisi sanda khembu ya mutu wuna wámutuma, yandi kyedika kisi zonza amana mwena yandi, mwakonda bikwaki.<verse eid="JHN 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Moyize káluhekamyoku Mitsiku? Kaasi keti mutu mosi hana kati dya benu, kisimyoku zitisa. Kikuma kya biki lubati sandila ni lwaphonda?» <verse eid="JHN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Mulumba-lumba wa batu wávutula: «Kiloki wenina kyawu! Nati wubati sanda mu kukuhonda?»<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Yesu wubavutwadini: «Muhangu wumosi lwesi phangikini amana benu boosu lubati yituka! <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Kikuma kya bwabuna kaluhekila Moyize mukhanda, -heku ni kwena Moyize wátukidila mukhanda kaasi kwena bakhaka benu - amana benu-benu yi kuyotisaka batu mu kilumbu kya sabata. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Yuka ni mutu bamuyotisa mu kilumbu kya sabata kikuma kya kuzitisa mitsiku mya Moyize, amana kikuma kya biki lubati ngyukila khabu, meni yandi mbeludi mutu yandi wosu mu kilumbu kya sabata? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Lufundisaku mu phila yina lubati monina benu. Kaasi pfundusu yenu yakala ya masonga.»<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu kenina Kidisitu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Bisi Yelusalemi bahika bakala zimbula: «Ka yandi ku babati sanda mu kuhondisa? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Talenu: kabati zonza wengele, amana babatiku muzimbwala keti kima! Disongidila bapfumu babakudi kyedika ni yandi kenina Kidisitu? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Kinga yandi tumuzayi kuna kátuka; ha kisi kwisa Kidisitu, heku mutu wisi zaya keti kubiki katukini.»<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Yesu, buna kakala longa muna nzu ya Nzambi, wákalunga: «Lunzayi amana luzayi phi kuna thukini? Kinga yidiyisilaku meni-meni, kaasi wuna wáthuma wakusila mbundu kenina, amana benu lumuzayiku. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Meni yimuzayi, kikuma kwena yandi thukini; amana yandi phi wáthuma.» <verse eid="JHN 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Bakala sanda ni bamukwatisa; kaasi keti mutu kalendaku mu kumusimba, kikuma hana tangwa dyandi khaku dilungila kedi. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Balawu hana kati dya mulumba-lumba wa batu, bákwikila mwena yandi amana bakala zimbula: «Ha kakwísa Kidisitu, bidimbu bya biphadi byahika kasála, kuluta bina kasadi mutu yandu?»<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Batsinzidi babahitikini kikuma kya kukwata Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Bafwadisi báyuka mulumba-lumba wa batu kufwetafweta kikuma kya Yesu. Hanga bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi bafwadisi batumini batsinzidi ndangu bamukwata. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Yesu wuzimbudini: «Tangwa dya khunda hika yikála yi benu, amana mvutuki kwena wuna wáthuma. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Lwakwata tsanda kaasi lwambónaku, kikuma benu lufwaniku mu kukwenda kuna yenina meni.» <verse eid="JHN 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Bayuta báyandika mu kudihyula bawu yi bawu: «Kubiki kakwénda ndangu betu tulengaku mumona? Kakwénda kwena Bayuta bana bámwangana muna bikanda bya bisi Ngeleti amana kalonga bisi Ngeleti? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Biki hika disongidila dya ndinga yina kazimbudini: Lwatsanda, kaasi lwambonaku kikuma benu lufwaniku mu kukwisa kuna yenina meni?»<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Banzadi ba mamba ma luzingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Amana muna kilumbu kya tsuka, kina kyambuta kya mukinzi, Yesu wamutendendi, wukalungini: «Ho mutu wenina yi kiwhinya, kisa kwena meni amana kanwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Masonuku mazimbudi: "Wuna wisi kwikila mwena meni, banzadi ba mamba ma luzingu batíka muna mbundu yandi.» <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Kakala zimbula bwabuna kikuma kya Kitembu kina bakhana tambula bana bakhana kwikila mwena yandi. Mukuma mwákalaku kedi yi Kitembu, kikuma hana Yesu khaniku kedi bamuzatula.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mulumba-lumba wudihambudi kikuma kya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Kunima dya kuyuka ndinga za Yesu, batu bakala muna bakala zimbula: «Mu kyedika yandu mbikudi!» <verse eid="JHN 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Bahika bakala zimbula: «Kidisitu yandu!» «Kaasi bakwawu hika bakala zimbula: Kidisitu fwani kalubukila ku Ngadidi? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Masonuku mazimbudiku ni Kidisitu katuka muna butuka dya Tavidi yi ku Betelemi, hata dina kakala zingila Tavidi.» <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Mulumba-lumba wa batu wádikabisa kikuma kya yandi. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Bahika hana kati dya bawu bakala zola ni bamukwata, kaasi keti mutu mosi kámekaku mu kumusimba.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikola mbundu kya bapfumu ba Bayuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Batsinzidi bávutuka kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi bafwadisi; baba-baba babazimbwadini: «Kikuma kya biki lukondi kwisila yandi?» <verse eid="JHN 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Batsinzidi bavutudini: «Twasalaku yuka kedi mutu wázonza bwabuna!» <verse eid="JHN 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Bafwadisi babavutwadini: «Benu phi ludiyambwadidi kwenu mu kuditotisa? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Henina yi mutu, hana kati dya bapfumu kondilo dya bafwadisi, wuna wukwikidini mwena yandi? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Kaasi mulumba-lumba wa batu babana bazayimyoku mitsiku. Bábabundila!»<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Nikodemi wuna watekila mumona, wákala phi mosi hana kati dya bawu, hanga wubahyudini: <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>«Mitsiku myetu, milungi mu kufundisa mutu wuna bakondi kedi fungwasa ndangu bazaya dyambu dina káhangini?» <verse eid="JHN 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Bámuvutwala: «Ngeyi phi mukwa Ngadidi wenina? Sanda mboti-mboti amana wamóna ni ku Ngadidi kwalubukilaku keti mbikudi mosi<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kufwanikisa yi khaphu ya 1:46; 7:41</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 7:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi mukhetu wa ndumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>[Kunima kosu mutu wénda ku nzu yandi.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Yesu wendi ku mongu wa miti mya Olive. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Kaasi muna suka, wávutuka ku nzu ya Nzambi amana batu boosu bisa kwena yandi. Buna kázakala, wáyandika mu kubalonga. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Hanga balongi ba mitsiku yi bafwadisi bisi nata mukhetu mosi wuna bákwata mu mbongi. Bamusini hana mbasi, <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>amana bazimbudi kwena Yesu: «Mulongi, tumukwatini mukhetu yandu mu kuta kwa mbongi. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Muna mitsiku mina kátuheka Moyize, kátuzimbwala ni bakhetu ba bwabuna, twabahondila ku matadi. Amana ngeyi bweti wuzimbudini?»<verse eid="JHN 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Bakala zimbula bwabuna mu kumuleya ndangu balenga mufundila. Kaasi Yesu wázenzama amana wáyandika mu kusonika ku mulembu hana tsi. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Bwosu bakala muhyula-hyula, wávumbuka amana wubazimbwadini: «Wuna wakonda disumu hana kati dya benu, kayandika watheti mu kumutimbwala tadi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Yesu wázenzama hika amana wáyandika mu kusonika hana tsi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Tangwa báyuka bwabuna, báyandika mu kuyombuka mosi-mosi, tukidila kwena bambuta; amana hásala lwesi Yesu yi mukhetu meni wuna hana mbasi. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Hanga Yesu wuvumbukini amana wumuzimbwadini: «A mukhetu, kubiki benina bana bisi kufundaka? Heku mutu wukuzengidi ndola?» <verse eid="JHN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Mukhetu wuvutudini: «Keti mutu loni Pfumu.» Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Meni phi yikuzengidiku ndola. Ndawenda, amana wusumukaku hika.»]<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna masonuku ma khulu, nzila za kutanga zazi: 7:53—8:11 zeninamwoku. Muna ndambu ya masonuku mahika, homa hahika básonikama (ku manima ma 8:36, yi ku manima ma 8:44 amana mbala za lawu, ku tsuka ya mukanda meni wawuwu wa Yowani). </char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, Mwini wa tsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Yesu wubazimbwadi hika: «Meni yenina mwini wa tsi. Wuna wisi ndanda, kakángalaku mu phipha keti koma, kaasi kavwa mwini wa luzingu.» <verse eid="JHN 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Kuna bafwadisi yi kumuzimbwalaka: «Kimbangi kya ngeyi-meni wubati ditila; kimbangi kyaku kyeku kya kyedika.» <verse eid="JHN 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Yesu wubavutwadini: «Ata meni-meni mbati ditila kimbangi, kimbangi kyama kya kyedika kyenina; mukuma nzayini kuna yítuka yi kuna mbati kwenda; benu luzayiku keti kuna yítuka, keti kuna mbati kwenda. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Benu lwisi fundisa mu kimutu, meni yisiku fundisa mutu. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Amana wadi ni meni yifundisaka, wadi pfundusu yama ya kyedika yakala, mukuma yeku meni hika; thwenina meni yi Tata wuna wáthuma. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Muna mitsiku myenu, básonika ni kimbangi kya batu boodi kyenina kya kyedika. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Meni mbati ta kimbangi kya meni-meni, amana Tata wuna wáthuma, kabati thila phi kimbangi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Hanga bamuhyudini: «Kubiki kenina Tata waku?» Yesu wubavutwadini: «Benu lunzayiku meni, keti Tata wama. Wadi lwanzayaka, wadi lukhani muzaya phi Tata wama.»<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Ndaka zina, kázonzilaza muna mukunzu wuna bakala swekila mbongu za bimenga, kuna yi kulongaka muna nzu ya Nzambi; Amana keti mutu wáfwana mu kumukwata kikuma tangwa dyandi dyáfwanaku kedi.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, mbambala wa Tata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Yesu wábazimbwala hika: «Meni yendini; benu lwatsánda; amana lwafwa mu disumu dyenu. Kuna yendini meni, benu lwaléndakwoku mu kukwisa.» <verse eid="JHN 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Bayuta bazimbudini: «Kadíhonda yandi-meni, hahana kazonzidini: Kuna, yendini meni, benu lwalendakwoku mu kukwisa?» <verse eid="JHN 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Yesu kakala bazimbwala: «Benu lwenina batu ba ha tsi, meni yenina wa ku zilu. Benu lwenina batu ba ha tsi yayi, meni yeku mutu wa ha tsi yayi. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Yihana yíluzimbwadiki ni lwafwa mu masumu menu. Kikuma yuka ni lukwikidiku ni "meni yenina", lwafwa muna masumu menu.» <verse eid="JHN 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Bawu bamuhyudini: «Ngeyi nani wenina?» Yesu wubavutwadini: «Kina yisi luzimbwala tukidila ku luyandiku. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Mambu ma lawu yenina mawu kikuma kya benu, mu kuluzimbwala yi mu kufundisa. Kaasi wuna wáthuma kenina kyedika; amana meni yisi zimbula kwena batu ba tsi kaka mana yíyuka kwena yandi.»<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Bawu bázayaku ni kikuma kya Tata kakala bazonzila kwena bawu. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Hanga Yesu wubazimbwadi hika: «Tangwa lwamútombula Mwana wa mutu, lwazáya ni meni yenina; lwázaya phi ni yisiku hanga kima mu phila ya meni-meni, yisi zonza kaka mambu mana kándonga Tata. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Wuna wáthuma kenina hakimosi yi meni, katsisaku buhika; kikuma yisi hanga kaka mambu mana misi muheka, yandi, kyesi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Bwosu kakala zimbula Yesu bwabuna, balawu bákwikila mwena yandi.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Batu ba kiphwanza yi bahika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Hanga Yesu wuzimbudini kwena Bayuta babana bákwikila mwena yandi: «Yuka ni lwazingilaka mu ndinga zama; mu kyedika balonguki bama lwenina; <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Bwabuna lwazáya kyedika amana kyedika kyalúlubula mu kihika.» <verse eid="JHN 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Bamuvutwadini: «Thwenina batekulu ba Bulahami; amana khaniku kedi tukala bahika ba mutu. Abweti wufweti tuzimbwala: "Lwalúbuka mu kihika?"» <verse eid="JHN 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Yesu wubavutwadini: «Yibatibwa luzimbwala, mu kyedika: mutu wosu wuna wisi hola disumu kenina muhika wa disumu. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Kinga muhika kisiku nangina mu nzu mu kimakulu; kaasi mwana kisimwa zingila mu kimakulu. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Yuka ni Mwana kalulubula mu kihika, mu kyedika, lwakítuka batu ba kiphwanza. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Nzayibwa ni batekulu ba Bulahami lwenina; kaasi lubati sanda ni lwaphonda, kikuma ndinga yama yisiku lutwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Meni yisi zimbula mana yímona kwena Tata, amana benu phi hangenu mana lwáyuka kwena tata wenu<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"Kwena tata wenu": mbakisilu yahika ya mihowu myami yenina "kwena Tata". Yibati zonza ni Yesu kázonzila Nzambi wuna wenina Tata wandi, yandi wuna phi wenina Tata wa Bulahami.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Bamuvutwadini: «Bulahami wenina tata wetu.» Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Wadi ni lwakala bana ba Bulahami, wadi lufweti hanga mihangu mya Bulahami. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Kaasi buthwena bwabu, lubati sanda ni lwaphonda, meni mutu yiluzimbwadini kyedika kina yíyuka kwena Nzambi. Bulahami káhangaku buna. <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Benu lwisi hanga mihangu mya tata wenu.» Bawu bamuvutwadini: «Twabutukilaku mu kindumba; thwenina yi Tata mosi, Nzambi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Wadi ni Nzambi kákala Tata wenu, wadi lwisi nzola, mukuma kwena Nzambi yílubwakila meni, kwakuna phi yítuka. Yidiyisilaku meni-meni, kaasi yandi wáthuma. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Kikuma kya biki lwisiku bakwala nzonzidi yama? Kikuma lwisiku lenda kuyuka ndinga yama. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Benu lwenina yi tata wenu kiphidi-mutu amana lwisi zola kuhanga buna kisi zola tata wenu. Tukidila ku luyandiku, yandi, muhondi wa batu kisi kala. Kisiku zingila mu kyedika; kikuma mwena yandi mwakonda kyedika. Yuka ni kata bukamvi, mambu ma yandi meni kisi zonzila, mukuma kenina yandi mutu mosi kingumba yi tata wandi. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Amana meni, lwisiku khwikila kikuma kyedika yisi zonza. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Nati hana kati dya benu wufwani mu kuthendisa mu mambu matadidini disumu? Yuka mbati zonza kyedika, kikuma kya biki lwisiku khwikidila? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Wuna wenina wa Nzambi, kisi yuka ndaka za Nzambi; kima lwisiku yukila benu, kikuma lweku ba Nzambi.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi Bulahami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Bayuta bavutudini kwena Yesu: «Kyedika twazimbulabwoku bwabuna ni ngeyi mwisi Samadiya wenina, amana kitembu kya mbi wenina kyawu?» <verse eid="JHN 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Yesu wubavutwadini: «Meni yeku yi kitembu kyambi, kaasi Tata wama yisi zitisa, amana benu lwisa ndewulaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Meni yisiku sanda khembu lwa meni-meni, henina yi mosi wisiya sanda, amana yandi wisi fundisa. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Mu kyedika, yiluzimwadibwa, yuka ni mutu kalunda ndinga zama, lufwa kamónalwoku mu kimakulu.»<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Amana Bayuta bamuzimbwadini: «Buthwena tuzayi ni kitembu kyambi wenina kyawu! Bulahami wafwa; bambikudi phi bafwa; amana ngeyi wubati zimbula: "Ho mutu kalema ndinga yama, lufwa kayedikalwoku mu kimakulu." <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Ngeyi wubanzini ni wuluti tata wetu Bulahami wuna wafwa? Bambikudi phi bafwa. Nati wisi dikitula ngeyi?» <verse eid="JHN 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Yesu wuvutudini: «Yuka ni meni-meni yibati dikembisa, khembu yama yeku mupfunu. Tata wama wisi khembisa, yandi wuna lwisi zimbula benu: "Nzambi wa betu kenina!" <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Amana lumuzayiku. Meni yimuzayini; amana ho yizimbula ni yimuzayiku, yikítuka mukwa luvunu hanga benu. Kaasi yimuzayini amana yisi lema ndinga yandi. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Tata wenu Bulahami kyesi lawu káyuka kikuma kya kumona kilumbu kyama; wámonakya amana wásangwala.» <verse eid="JHN 8:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Bayuta bamuzimbwadini: «Khaku kedi wulungisa keti mvula makumatanu, amana wámumona Bulahami?» <verse eid="JHN 8:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Mu kyedika yibati luzimbwala: ku thwala kubutuka kwa Bulahami, "meni yenina"» <verse eid="JHN 8:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Hanga batongunini matadi ndangu bamuta; kaasi Yesu wádisweka amana wálubuka mu nzu ya Nzambi.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubukini mutu mosi wábutuka phofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Yesu kákala mu kuhita, wumoni mutu mosi wákala phofu tukidila ku lubutuku lwandi. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Balonguki bandi bamuhyudini: «Mulongi, nati wáhola disumu ndangu mutu yandu kakituka phofu: yandi ho bibuti byandi?» <verse eid="JHN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Yesu wubavutwadini: «Heku ni yandi holo bibuti byandi báhola disumu. Kábutukila bwabuna ndangu mihangu mya Nzambi myamonikina mwena yandi. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Buna kwenina mwini, bwabuna tufwani mu kusala bisalu bya wuna wáthuma. Phipha yekina bwa, heku mutu wufwani mu kuhanga muhangu wumosi. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Mu tangwa dina yenina ha tsi, yenina mwini wa tsi.» <verse eid="JHN 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Buna kázonza bwabuna, wálokula metya hana tsi amana wáyidika thoba yi metya mandi; kunima wákusa thoba meni zina muna mesu ma phofu <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>amana wumuzimbwadini: «Ndawenda disukula kuna kiziba kya Silowe.» -Disongidila ni «Kituma.» - Phofu wenda disukula mbunzu kwakuna; tangwa kávutukisa, kakala mona! <verse eid="JHN 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Batu bana kábandakana bawu yi bana bakala mumona theti buna kakala lomba bima kwena batu bakala zimbula: «Ka yandi ku mutu wuna wisi zakala mu nzila mu kulomba bima?» <verse eid="JHN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Bamosi bakala zimbula: «Yandi wuna.» Bahika bakala zimbula: «Loni, mutu wamufwana». Yandi-meni kakala zimbula: «Meni yandu.» <verse eid="JHN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Amana bakala muzimbwala: «Abweti matemukini mesu maku?» <verse eid="JHN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Yandi wubavutwadini: «Mutu wuna bisi tela Yesu káyidikiki thoba, wukhusiza muna mesu amana wunzimbwadini: "Ndawenda disukula kuna Silowe." Hangi yendi kwakuna amana yidisukudini, ngyandiki phi mu kumona!» <verse eid="JHN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Bamuzimbwadini: «Kubiki kenina mutu meni yayina?» Yandi wuvutudini: «Nzayiku».<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafwadisi bamuhyudi phofu wuna wábeluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Bámunata mutu wuna wákala phofu kwena bafwadisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Kinga, kilumbu kya sabata kyákala kyakina káyidika Yesu thoba amana wámutemuna mesu. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Bafwadisi, bawu phi bámuhyula mutu wuna, keti bweti káyandikila mu kumona. Yandi wubazimbwadini: «Kakhusikini thoba muna mesu, yidisukudini mbunzu amana mbonini.» <verse eid="JHN 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Ndambu ya bafwadisi bakala zimbula: «Mutu yandu kátukaku kwena Nzambi, kikuma kazitisidyoku sabata.» Bahika bakala zimbula: «Abweti ni musumuki kafwani mu kusala bidimbu bya biphadi bya mutindu wuna?» Amana bádikabisa bawu yi bawu. <verse eid="JHN 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Bázimbula hika kwena phofu: «A ngeyi meni, biki wubati zimbula kikuma kya yandi wukutemunini mesu?» Yandi wuvutudini: «Mbikudi kenina.»<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Bayuta bákwikilaku ni phofu kákala amana mesu mámutemuka. Yihakana bátedisila bibuti byandi <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>amana babahyudini: «Yandi-wu mwana wenu wuna lwisi zimbula ni phofu kábutuka? Amana bweti kayandikidini mu kumonina buthwena?» <verse eid="JHN 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Bibuti byandi bazimbudini: «Tuzayi ni mwana wetu kenina, kábutuka phi phofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Kaasi tuzayiku keti khi phila kátemwani mesu, amana nati wumutemuni mesu, betu, tuzayibwoku. Muhyulenu yandi meni; mbuta kenina mu kutendula mambu mandi!» <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Kima bázonzila bwabuna bibuti byandi, kikuma kya bweya bwa Bayuta; mukuma Bayuta báyukana mu kukula, mu nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta, wuna watámbwasa ni Yesu kenina Kidisitu. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Yihakana bibuti byandi bázimbwala: «Mbuta kenina, muhyulenu yandi meni!»<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Bafwadisi bamutedi mbala ya zodi mutu wuna wákala phofu amana bamuzimbwadini: «Ngeyi hana khembu kwena Nzambi; Betu tuzayi ni mutu wuna kenina musumuki.» <verse eid="JHN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Yandi wuvutudini: «Nzayiku yuka ni musumuki kenina. Kaasi kima kimosi nzayini: phofu khadikini, buthwena mbati mona.» <verse eid="JHN 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Bawu bamuzimbwadini: «Biki kákuhangikini? Abweti kákutemunima mesu?» <verse eid="JHN 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Yandi wubavutwadini: «Yíluzimbwadiki kedi, kaasi luyukikiku. Kikuma kya biki lubati zodila mu kuyukilabwa hika? Benu phi luzodi ni lwakituka balonguki bandi?» <verse eid="JHN 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Bámutukwana amana bamuzimbwadini: «Ngeyi wenina mulonguki wa mutu wuna; betu thwenina balonguki ba Moyize. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Tuzayi ni Nzambi kwena Moyize kázonzila; kaasi yandu-yandu, tuzayiku keti kubiki katukini!» <verse eid="JHN 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Mutu wuna wubavutwadini: «Taleti dyambu dya kuyituka: benu luzayiku keti kubiki katukini, kinga yandi wuthemunima mesu! <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Tuzayi ni Nzambi kisiku yukila basumuki, kaasi yuka ni mutu wisi zitisa Nzambi, wisi sala phi luzolu lwandi, kisi muyukila. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Khaku kedi tuyuka keti mbala mosi mutu watemuna mesu ma mutu wábutuka phofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Wadi ni mutu yandi kátukaku kwena Nzambi, wadi kakhaniku sala kima.» <verse eid="JHN 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Bamuvutwadini: «Ngeyi mutu ni mu masumu wábutukila ngeyi wosu, amana wuzodini ni watulonga?» Hanga bamulubudini mu nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Buphofu bwa kitembu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Yesu wáyuka ni bafwadisi bámukukwasa mutu wuna. Wámutundakana amana wumuzimbwadini: «Ngeyi wubati kwikila mwena Mwana wa mutu?» <verse eid="JHN 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Wumuvutwadini: «Nati kenina, Pfumu, ndangu yikwikila mwena yandi?» <verse eid="JHN 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Wubati mumona; yandina wubati kuzonzisa, yandi wuna.» <verse eid="JHN 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Hanga mutu wuna wuzimbudini: «Khwikidini, Pfumu.» Amana wáfukama kuna thwala ya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Amana Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Meni, yisa mu tsi yayi kikuma kya pfundusu yimosi: ndangu bana bisiku mona, bamona, amana bana bisi mona bakituka baphofu.» <verse eid="JHN 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Kunima dya kuyuka bwabuna, ndambu ya bafwadisi bana bákala kumosi yi yandi bamuhyudini: «Betu phi baphofu thwenina?» <verse eid="JHN 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Yesu wubavutwadini: «Wadi lwákala baphofu, wadi lweku yi disumu; kaasi buthwena lubati zimbula: "Tubati mona", amana disumu dyenu disadini bwabuna.»<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Kalema yi mikoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Yesu wuzimbudini: «Mu kyedika yibatibwa luzimbwala: wuna wisiku kotila ku mwelu mu dinda dya mikoku, kaasi wisi kotila mu kuzanza kuma kwahika, yandi kenina mwifi yi ndwandwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Kaasi mutu wuna wisi kotila ku mwelu, kenina kalema ka mikoku. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Yandi bisi yafwadila mwelu kwena tsinzidi, mikoku myisi yuka ndinga yandi; kisi tela mikoku mya yandi-meni muna khumbu ya bawu amana wulubudimya ku phenza. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>Buna kalubudimya myosu, yandi wuhitini kuna thwala ya myawu, mikoku mimulandini, kikuma mizayiya ndinga yandi. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Myalendaku landa munzenza ketibwe; myamútina, kikuma mizayiku ndinga ya banzenza.»<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Yesu wábaheka mbandu yina, kaasi bawu bábakulamoku mana kakala bazimbwala.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, kalema wabukheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Yesu wábazimbwala hika: «Mu kyedika yibati luzimbwala: meni yenina mwelu wa mikoku. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Boosu bana bisa ku thwala meni benina befi yi bandwandwa; kaasi mikoku myábayukilaku. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Meni yenina mwelu. Yuka ni mutu kakotila mwena meni, kahúluka; kakóta amana kalúbuka, kawána phi phila za bukheti. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Mwifi kisi kwisila lwesi kikuma kya kuyiba, kuhonda yi kuzanga. Meni, yísila ndangu batu bavwa luzingu amana bavwalwa lwa lawu-lawu. <verse eid="JHN 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>Meni yenina kalema wabukheti. Kalema wabukheti kisi lambula luzingu lwandi kikuma kya mikoku myandi. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Wuna wisi sala lwesi kikuma kya mbongu, wuna wukondi vwa mikoku mya yandi meni keku musadi wakyedika; buna kamóna mbwa-ngongu, hanga sadi sisa mikoku, yandi wutini. Amana mbwa-ngongu kakwáta mikoku, wumwangimya. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Kikuma yandi mbongu kisi sadila, kisiku kala yi kiwayi kya mikoku. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>Meni yenina kalema wabukheti. Nzayimya mikoku myama, amana mikoku myama phi minzayini, <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>bwosu buna kanzayi meni Tata, meni phi yimuzayini. Amana yisi lambula luzingu lwama kikuma kya mikoku myama. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Mvwini mikoku myahika, mina mikondi kala mu dinda dyadi. Mboti yihungulamya phi myamina ndangu bakobila, myayúka ndinga yama, amana myakítuka kibuka kimosi yi muhungudi mosi. <verse eid="JHN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>Yuka ni Tata kisi nzola, kikuma meni mbati hana luzingu lwama, ndangu yitambulalwa hika. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Heku mutu wakhátulalwa, kaasi meni-meni yisilwa hana muna luzolu lwama. Yenina yi hamu dya kuhanalwa yi kuvutwakilalwa hika. Kyakina kizila yítambula kwena Tata.»<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Ngyengu yákota hika hana kati dya Bayuta kikuma kya ndinga meni zina. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Balawu hana kati dya bawu bakala zimbula: «Kitembu kya mbi kenina kyawu! Kilawu kenina! Biki lubati muyukila?» <verse eid="JHN 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Bahika bakala zimbula: «Ndaka zina zeku za kitembu kya mbi. Mutu wenina yi kitembu kyambi fwani kutemuna mesu ma phofu?»<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayuta bamulosidini Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Muna tangwa meni dina dya kyosi, mwamuna bakala ta mukinzi wa kusambula nzu ya Nzambi kuna Yelusalemi. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Yesu kakala kangala hana kyanzala kya nzu ya Nzambi, muna mbalanda yina bakala tela ni ya Solumoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Bayuta bámuzyeta, beka muzimbwala: «Yi kuna khi tangwa watusisa mu tsumbi? Yuka ni ngeyi wenina Kidisitu, tuzimbwala phwelele.» <verse eid="JHN 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Yesu wubavutwadini: «Yíluzimbwadikibwa kedi, kaasi lukhwikidikiku. Mihangu myama mina yisi hanga mu khumbu ya Tata wama, myamina myisi thila kimbangi. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Kaasi yuka ni lubatiku khwikila, kikuma kya buna lweku mu kibuka kya mikoku myama. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Mikoku myama myisi yuka ndinga yama; meni nzayimya, amana myawu phi myisi ndanda. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Yisimya heka luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula, myatótaku keti bweti amana heku mutu wakwisamya botula ha moku ma meni. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Bina kápheka Tata bilutini byosu, amana heku mutu fwani kabotula kima ha moku ma Tata. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Tata yi meni thwenina kima kimosi.»<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Bayuta bátonguna hika matadi ndangu bamuta. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Mihangu mya bukheti mya lawu yílusongila, mina myátuka kwena Tata. Kikuma kya khi muhangu, mukati kya myawu, lubati nzukwamina matadi?» <verse eid="JHN 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Bayuta bamuvutwadini: «Heku ni kikuma kya muhangu wabukheti twakúzukwaminina matadi, kaasi kikuma kya malewu maku kwena Nzambi: ngeyi mutu wenina, amana wubati dikitula Nzambi!» <verse eid="JHN 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Yesu wubavutwadini: «Muna mitsiku myenu, básonikaku bwabu: "Meni yízimbula: benu, banzambi lwenina<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkg 82:6</char></note>." <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Bwabuna masonuku mábatedila banzambi, kwena batu babana báhitikaya ndinga ya Nzambi, amana masonuku malendaku mu kuzima. <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Amana benu lwazimbulaka kwena wuna kásola Tata, kátuma phi ha tsi ni Nzambi wubati lewula? Kikuma kya buna nzimbudini ni Mwana wa Nzambi yenina? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Yuka ni yisiku sala mihangu mya Tata wama, lukhwikilaku. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Kaasi yuka ni mbatimya hanga ata lukhwikidiku meni, kwikilenu ata mu mihangu myamina; zayenu amana bakisenubwoku ni bwosu buna kenina Tata mwena meni, bwabuna yenina meni phi mwena Tata.» <verse eid="JHN 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Básanda hika ni bamukwata, kaasi yandi wábatina. <verse eid="JHN 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Yesu wávutuka ku sambwa dikwawu dya Yolutani, hana sabu dina kákala botikila theti Yowani, amana wánangina kwakuna. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Batu lawu bisa kwena yandi, beka zimbula: «Yowani kásalaku keti kidimbu kya kiphadi kimosi, kaasi moosu mana kázimbula Yowani kikuma kya mutu yandu menina ma kyedika.» <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Amana hahana, batu balawu bákwikila mwena yandi.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lwa Lasalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Mutu mosi wákala wabela, khumbu yandi Lasalu, mwisi Betaniya, hata dya Madiya yi Malata phangi wandi wa mukhetu. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Madiya, yi yandi wuna wámusita Pfumu mananasi amana wámukumuna bitambi yi tsuki zandi, amana phangi wandi wa yakala, Lasalu, yandi wákala wabela. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Baphangi ba bakhetu batumini mutu mosi kenda muzimbwala Yesu: «Pfumu, nduku waku wabela kenina.» <verse eid="JHN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Buna káyuka bwabuna, Yesu wuzimbudini: «Maladi mana misiku nata ku lufwa; menina kikuma kya khembu ya Nzambi, ndangu muna maladi meni mamana, bamukembisa Mwana wa Nzambi.»<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Kinga Yesu kakala bazola Malata, Madiya phangi wa mukhetu Malata yi Lasalu. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Tangwa káyuka ni Lasalu wabela kenina, kahanga wunangi hika bilumbu byodi kwakuna kákala. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Kunima wázimbula kwena balonguki bandi: «Tuvutukenu ku Yuteya.» <verse eid="JHN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Balonguki bamuzimbwadini: «Mulongi, buthwena bákasandaka Bayuta ni bakuhondila ku matadi, amana wavutuka hika kwakuna?» <verse eid="JHN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Yesu wuvutudini: «Muna kilumbu mwisiku kala matangwa kumi yi modi? Yuka ni mutu kakangala mu mwini, kisiku tyelumuka, kikuma kabati mona mwini wa tsi yayi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Kaasi yuka ni mutu kakangala mu phipha, kisi tyelumuka, kikuma mwena yandi, mwakonda mwini.» <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Kunima dya kuzimbula bwabuna, Yesu wuyikini: «Nduku wetu Lasalu wunimbini, kaasi yikwenda mutokamisa ku kilu kyandi.» <verse eid="JHN 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Balonguki bamuzimbwadini: «Pfumu, yuka ni kanimbini, kahúluka.» <verse eid="JHN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Lufwa lwandi kázonzila Yesu bwabuna kaasi bawu bakala banza ni kilu kwandi. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Hanga Yesu wubazimbwadini phwelele: «Lazalu wufuni. <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>Yenina yi kyesi kikuma kya benu, mukuma khádikikwoku kwana; ndangu lwakwikila. Kaasi thwendenu kuna kenina.» <verse eid="JHN 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Tomasi wuna bisi tela ni diphasa, hanga wuzimbudi kwena balonguki bahika: «Thwendenu, betu phi, kwakuna ndangu twafwa kumosi yi yandi!»<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu kenina lufutumuku yi luzingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Buna kátula Yesu, wumoni ni bilumbu byekina kedi biya, tukidila buna bamusidikini Lazalu mu mazyamu. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Kinga Betaniya bela-bela dyákala yi Yelusalemi, kitesu kya makilometele matatu, <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Bayuta balawu phi bisa kwakuna mu kubadidisa Madiya yi Malata kikuma kya lufwa lwa phangi wa bawu wa yakala. <verse eid="JHN 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Malata buna káyuka ni Yesu kabati kwisa, wenda mutundakana; kaasi Madiya yandi kásala wasikuka kuna nzu. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Malata wázimbula kwena Yesu: «Pfumu, wadi ni wákala haka, wadi phangi wama kakhaniku fwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Kaasi nzayi ni ata buthwena bwabu, moosu mana walómba kwena Nzambi, kakúhekama.» <verse eid="JHN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Phangi waku kafútumuka.» <verse eid="JHN 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Malata wumuvutwadini: «Nzayi ni kafútumuka mu kilumbu kya tsuka kya lufutumuku lwa bafwa.» <verse eid="JHN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Meni, yenina lufutumuku yi luzingu. Wuna wakwíkila mwena meni, ata kafwini, kazínga; <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>amana wuna wisi zinga, wisi kwikila phi mwena meni kafwáku mu kimakulu. Wukwikidibwa bwabuna?» <verse eid="JHN 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Malata wuvutudini: «Eeh, Pfumu, meni khwikidini ni ngeyi wenina Kidisitu, Mwana wa Nzambi, wuna wálunga mu kukwisa mu tsi.»<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudidini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Kunima dya kuzimbula bwabuna, Malata wenda amana wámutela phangi wandi wa mukhetu Madiya amana wumuzimbwadi mu kitsweki: «Mulongi wutudi kedi, kabati kutela.» <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Buna káyuka bwabuna, Madiya wátelama tswatsu mu kwenda kwena Yesu; <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>mukuma hana Yesu khaniku kedi kakota mu hata; hana kámutundakanina Malata, hahana kákala. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Bayuta bana bákala yi Madiya mu nzu kikuma kya kumuhomba bámumona ni wutelami tswatsu amana wulubukini; hanga bamulandini, kikuma bábanza ni wendi dila ku mazyamu. <verse eid="JHN 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Madiya buna kátula hana kákala Yesu yi buna kámumona, wáfukama muna malu mandi amana wuzimbudini: «Pfumu, wadi haka wukadikini, wadi phangi wama kakhaniku fwa.» <verse eid="JHN 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Yesu buna kámumona Madiya ni kabati dila yi Bayuta bana bisa mulanda phi mu kudila, hanga wuyuki kyadi mu mbundu yandi amana mabanza mamuvwalangani. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>Wuzimbudini: «Kubiki lumusikini?» Bamuvutwadini: «Ah Pfumu, awisa amana wamóna.» <verse eid="JHN 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Yesu wánokisa matsanga. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Hanga Bayuta bazimbudini: «Talenu buna kámuzola!» <verse eid="JHN 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Kaasi batu bahika hana kati dya bawu bazimbudini: «Yandi wábuka mesu ma phofu, abweti kákondikiku kandisa ni mutu yandu kafwaku?»<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lazalu bamuvutudi mu luzingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Yesu, mbundu yámulwala hika, wenda kuna mazyamu. Mákala makutunga mu kitadi, bákidika kalunga tadi kuna thwala. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Yesu wuzimbudini: «Katulenu tadi». Malata, phangi wa mukhetu wa mvumbi, wumuzimbwadini: «A Pfumu, tsudi kábati lubuka, mukuma lelu kilumbu kya ya.» <verse eid="JHN 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Yikuzimbwadikibwoku ni yuka wukwikidini, wamóna khembu ya Nzambi?» <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Hanga bakatudi tadi. Yesu wásekula mesu amana wuzimbudini: «Tata, yikuvutwadi matondu kikuma kya buna wungyukidini. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Nzayi mboti ni wisi ngyukila kosu tangwa, kaasi nzonzidibwa kikuma kya batu baba banzyetini haka ndangu bakwikila ni ngeyi wáthuma.» <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Kunima dya kuzimbula bwabuna, wákalunga: «Lasalu, lubuka!» <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Amana mvumbi wálubuka; moku yi malu makuzinga mu bitemba bya muledi; mbunzu yandi phi yakuvunga yi kitemba. Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Mukutumunenu amana muyambulenu kenda.»<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamukasidi fwongu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mth 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Bayuta balawu, hana kati dya babana bisa kwena Madiya, bámona phi mambu mana káhanga Yesu amana bákwikila mwena yandi. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Kaasi bakwawu hana kati dya bawu benda wana bafwadisi amana bábamenika phi mambu mana káhanga Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Hanga bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi bafwadisi bakhokisini kimvuka kya mbuta amana bazimbudini: «Biki twahanga? Mukuma mutu yandu kabati sala bidimbu bya biphadi lawu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mth 5:22</char></note>! <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Yuka ni twamutanikina bwabuna, batu boosu bakwíkila mwena yandi, amana bisi Loma bakwisakya zanga kizika kyetu yi kanda dyetu!» <verse eid="JHN 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Kaasi mosi hana kati dya bawu, khumbu yandi Khayifu, wuna wákala mbuta wa banganga Nzambi muna mvula meni yina, hanga wubazimbwadini: «Benu lubatiku bakisa kima! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Lumonibwoku ni bulungi mutu mosi kafwa kikuma kya batu, ndangu kanda dyosu ditotaku?» <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Kinga mambu mana makalaku tuka kwena yandi-meni, kaasi bwosu kákala mbuta wa banganga Nzambi muna mvula meni yina, hahana kázonzila mu kubikula ni Yesu wáfwana mu kufwa kikuma kya kanda dyosu. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>Heku ni kikuma kya kanda lwesi, kaasi kikuma kya kukhundikisa mu kimvuka kimosi bana ba Nzambi babana bámwangana.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Tukidila kilumbu kyakina, bábonga lukanu lwa kumuhonda Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Kikuma kya bwabuna Yesu káyambwala mu kukangadila ha kati dya Bayuta mu kitengeni. Kaasi wákatuka hana, wenda ku kinzunga kina kyákala bela-bela yi nganga, muna mbanza ya Efwayimi, wánanga kwakuna yi balonguki bandi.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Mukinzi wa Phaki ya Bayuta wábwesuka amana batu balawu bátombuka ku Yelusalemi kikuma kya kudisemisa ku thwala ya mukinzi meni wuna. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Hanga beka musanda Yesu muna nzu ya Nzambi, yi kudizimbwalaka bawu yi bawu: «Biki lubati banza? Kakwísakwoku hika ku mukinzi?» <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Kinga bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi bafwadisi batekila dihanina muswa ndangu, yuka ni mutu wuzayini kuna kenina Yesu, kabazimbwala ndangu bamukwata.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamusiti mananasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mth 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mlk 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Bilumbu bisambanu ku thwala mukinzi wa Phaki ya Bayuta, Yesu wísa ku Betaniya, kuna kákala Lasalu wuna káfutumuna ku bafwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Bámuheka madya kwakuna. Malata kakala basadila amana Lasalu kákala mosi wa batu babana bákala ku mesa yi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Hanga Madiya wubongini kati-kati dya mulangi wa mananasi ma mukwandi, mana bisi yidika yi miti wa nadi; wásitama kuna bitambi bya Yesu amana wámukumuna bitambi yi tsuki zandi. Nzu yosu yákandumuka yi mvumba ya mananasi. <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Mosi wa balonguki bandi, Yutasi Sikadyoti, wuna wakhana mulambula, hanga wuzimbudini: <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>«Kikuma kya biki bakondi tekisila mananasi mana mu khama tatu za phata<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ywn 6:7. </char></note>, ndangu bahana mbongu kwena baphutu?» <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Heku ni kikuma kya kiwayi kya baphutu kázimbwala bwabuna, kaasi kikuma mwifi kákala amana bwosu kakala lema waba dya mbongu, kakala loya zina bakalamwa sya. <verse eid="JHN 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Kaasi Yesu wuzimbudini: «Muyambula! Kikuma kya kilumbu kya kuzikama kwama káswekilama. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Kikuma baphutu lwakadiki bawu kosu tangwa, kaasi meni, yikadikiku yenu kosu tangwa.»<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kifwandu kikuma kya Lasalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Mulumba-lumba wa batu wa Bayuta lawu báyuka ni Yesu ku Betaniya kákala, bísa kwakuna; bendaku lwesi mu kutala Yesu, kaasi benda phi ndangu bamumona phi Lasalu wuna káfutumuna ku bafwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Hanga bambuta ba banganga Nzambi bayukani ni bamuhondisa phi Lasalu; <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>kikuma Bayuta balawu bakalakwa kwenda kikuma kya yandi Lasalu amana bakala kwikila mwena Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukoti mu Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mth 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Kilumbu kyálanda, mulumba-lumba wa batu bana bísa kikuma kya mukinzi wa Phaki ya Bayuta báyuka ni Yesu kabati kwisa ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Batu bábonga ndala za mbati amana benda mukhikidila, mu kukalunga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">«Ozana!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">kasambuka wuna wisi kwisila mu khumbu ya Pfumu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Kyamvu wa Kiseledi!» <verse eid="JHN 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Yesu wámona mwana wa ane, amana wázakala hana thandu, bwosu básonika:<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>«Yukaku bweya, mwana wa ndumba wa Siyoni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Tala, kyamvu waku wisini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">wazakala hana thandu ya mwana wa ane<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna bikalulu bya bikanda byahika, mbisi wuna ane bakala musadila hanga mbisi wuna wisi tikula mazitu. Kenina wakhunda kuluta baphunda bana bakodini. Bisi muzayila muna matu mandi ma kaleyi. Ane kenina kidimbu kya kudikulumuna kwa Masiya.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Balonguki bandi bábakulaku theti mambu mana; kaasi tangwa bámukembisa Yesu, hanga bayubuki nana ni mamana másonama kikuma kya yandi, amana bahanga bwabuna kikuma kya yandi.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Mulumba-lumba wa batu babana bákala hakana yi Yesu, ha kámutela Lasalu mu mazyamu kikuma kya kumufutumuna ku bafwa; bakala ta kimbangi. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Yihana mulumba-lumba wa batu bisa mukhikidila, mukuma báyuka ni yandi wáhanga kiphadi kina. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Bafwadisi bakala dizimbwala bawu yi bawu: «Lumoni ni lubatiku lenda kwenu kima; taleti tsi yosu yendi mulanda!»<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndambu ya Bangeleki basandi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Hana kati dya batu babana bátombuka ku Yelusalemi mu kufukamina Nzambi mu tangwa dya mukinzi, hákala yi ndambu ya Bangeleki. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Buna bábwesuka kwena Fidiphu, mwisi Betisayita dya kinzunga kya Ngadidi, bamuhyudini: «A Pfumu, tubati zola ni twamona Yesu.» <verse eid="JHN 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Fidiphu wendi zimbula kwena Andele; bawu boodi bendabwa zimbula kwena Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Yesu wubavutwadini: «Tangwa dilungidini ndangu bamukembisa Mwana wa mutu. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Mu kyedika, mbati luzimbwala: yuka ni ngenza ya bule yibwiku mu mafu amana yivundiku; yanánga yawu buhika. Kaasi yuka ni yavunda, yisi buta hika ngenza za lawu . <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Wuna wisi zola luzingu lwandi, katótisalwa, kaasi wuna wisi menga luzingu lwandi ha tsi yayi, katámbula luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Yuka ni mutu wuzodi ni kasadila meni, kandanda, amana hana yikála meni, hahana phi kakála musadi wama. Yuka ni mutu kasadila meni, Tata wama wamúzatula.»<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuzonzidini lufwa lwandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>«Buthwena mbundu yama yivwalangani. Amana biki yizónza? Yizimbula: Tata, Phulula mu tangwa dyadi? Loni. Kaasi kikuma kya bwabuna thudidini ku tangwa dyadi. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Tata, kembisa khumbu yaku.» Amana ndinga mosi yáyukalakana kuna zilu: «Khembisiya kedi, yikémbisaya hika.» <verse eid="JHN 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Mulumba-lumba wa batu babana bákala hana, báyuka phi ndinga yina, bakala zimbula: «Mukumini wa mvula wuna.» Bahika bakala zimbula: «Wanzyo mosi wumuzonzisini.» <verse eid="JHN 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Kaasi Yesu wávutwakila hika: «Ndinga yina yiyukalakaniku kikuma kya meni, kaasi kikuma kya benu. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Buthwena bwabu yenina pfundusu ya tsi yayi; buthwena meni bwabu bamúlubula ku phenza pfumu wa tsi yayi. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Amana meni, tangwa bathómbula ha thandu ya tsi, yibáhungula batu boosu kwena meni.» <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Kázonzila bwabuna mu kusongila phila ya lufwa luna kafwana mu kufwila. <verse eid="JHN 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Mulumba-lumba wa batu wumuvutwadini: «Mitsiku myetu mizonzini ni Kidisitu kanánga mu kimakulu. Abweti ngeyi wubati zimbwala hika ni bulungi Mwana wa mutu bamutombula? Nati kenina Mwana wa mutu meni wawuna?» <verse eid="JHN 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Mwini wenina kedi hana kati dya benu, mu tangwa dya khunda; kangalakenu buna kwenina mwini, ndangu phipha yilubwilaku; mukuma, wuna wisi kangala mu phipha kisiku zaya kuna kisi kwenda. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Buna lwenina yi mwini, kwikilenu mwena wuna wisi hana mwini, ndangu lwakituka bana ba mwini.»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 12:36">Bayuta balawu bisiku kwikila mwena Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Kunima dya kuzimbula bwabuna, Yesu wenda amana wáswama kyana yi bawu. <verse eid="JHN 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Mbatanana bidimbu bya biphadi byalawu bina kásala mu mesu ma bawu, bawu bakalaku mukwikila, <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>ndangu yalungila ndinga ya mbikudi Yesaya, yina kázimbula:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">«Pfumu, nati wukwikidikini mu malongi metu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Amana kwena nati básongilaza ngolu za Pfumu?»<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Kikuma kya bwabuna, bálendaku mu kukwikila, kikuma Yesaya kázimbula hika:<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>«Nzambi wufidingima mesu ma bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">amana wuzitikini mbundu ya bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">ndangu bamonaku yi mesu ma bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">babakulaku yi mbundu ya bawu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">amana bavutukisaku</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">wadi yikhana babelula.»<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Bwabuna kázimbula Yesaya, kikuma wámona khembu yandi amana wámuzonzila phi.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Kinga, keti hana kati dya bapfumu, balawu bákwikila mwena yandi, kaasi bakalabwoku zonzila ha mesu mathona, kikuma kya bafwadisi, ndangu babakukwasa nana ku nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Mukuma bakala zola khembu ya batu kuluta khembu ya Nzambi.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi matadidini pfundusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Yesu wázonza mu ndinga ya ngolu amana wuzimbudini: «Wuna wisi kwikila mwena meni, kisiku kwikila mwena meni, kaasi mwena wuna wáthuma. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Amana wuna wumbonini, wumoni phi wuna wáthuma. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Meni, mwini, yisa ha tsi, ndangu wuna wakwíkila mwena meni kanangaku mu phipha. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Yuka ni mutu wuyuki ndinga zama amana kalundizoku, ka meni ku yimufundisini; mukuma yisilaku kikuma kya kufundisa tsi, kaasi kikuma kya kuhulula tsi. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Mutu wuna wundosidini, wukondi phi tambwasa ndinga zama kenina yi zusi mosi. Ndinga meni yina nzimbudini, yawu yamúfundisa mu kilumbu kya tsuka. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Mukuma meni, yízonzilaku mu mabanza mama, Tata wuna wáthuma, yandi-meni wátsenda mu kuhanga buna pfwani mu kuzimbula yi buna pfwani mu kuzonza. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Amana nzayi ni buna kisi senda yandi bwisi hana luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula. Yihana ni, mambu mana yisi zonza meni, yisima zonza bwosu buna kátsendabwa Tata.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusukudini malu ma balonguki bandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Ku thwala ya mukinzi wa Phaki ya Bayuta, Yesu bwosu kázaya ni tangwa dyandi dilungidini, dina kafweti katuka ha tsi yayi ndangu kenda kwena Tata, yandi watoma zola batu bandi babana bákala mu tsi; kábazola yikuna tsuka. <verse eid="JHN 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Muna tangwa dina bákala mu kudya. Hana kiphidi-mutu wusi kedi dibanza dya kumulambula kuna mbundu ya Yutasi, mwana wa Simoni Sikadyoti; <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Yesu, bwosu kázaya ni Tata wáhana byosu hana moku mandi; ni kwena Nzambi kátuka, kwena Nzambi phi kavútukisa, <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>muna tangwa dya kudya, wátelama, wáwomuna muledi wandi wa thandu amana wádizitikila kitemba kimosi muna mbunda. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Kunima, wásya mamba hana dilonga amana wáyandika mu kusukula malu ma balonguki bandi, yi kukumunakama yi kitemba kina kyákala muna mbunda. <verse eid="JHN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Buna kátula kwena Simoni Phetelu, yandi Phetelu wumuzimbwadini: «Pfumu, ngeyi watsukula malu?» <verse eid="JHN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Mana mbati hanga meni buthwena bwabu, ngeyi wubatimoku bakisa, kunima nana wazáyama.» <verse eid="JHN 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Phetelu wumuzimbwadini: «Loni, ketibwe watsukula malu.» Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Yuka ni yikusukudimoku, wakálaku hika hakimosi yi meni.» <verse eid="JHN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Simoni Phetelu wumuzimbwadini: «Yuka ni yibwabuna dyenina, Pfumu, tsukulaku lwesi malu, kaasi yi moku mama yi mutwa wama!» <verse eid="JHN 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Mutu wuna wuyebidiki kedi lutu lwosu, keku yi mupfunu wa kudiyebisa, malu lwesi, wakasemi kenina yandi wosu. Benu phi ba kasemi lwenina, kaasi ka benu boosu ku.» <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Kikuma Yesu wázaya kwandi keti nati wakhana mulambula, yihana kázimbwala: «Ka benu boosu ku lwenina ba kasemi.»<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Kunima dya kubasukula malu yi kuvwata miledi myandi, wávutuka ku mesa, amana wubazimbwadini: «Lubakudini kikuma kya dyambu dyadi yiluhangidini? <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Benu lwisi thela ni "Mulongi" yi "Pfumu", kyedika lwisi zonza, mukuma bwabuna yenina. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Amana yuka ni meni, Pfumu yi Mulongi yilusukudini malu, benu phi lufweti disukula malu, benu yi benu. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Mbandu yiluhekini, ndangu benu phi lwahanga bwosu buna phangini meni kikuma kya benu. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadibwa: musadi kahitiku pfumu wandi amana thumwa kahitiku wuna wámutuma. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Yuka ni luzayi bwabuna, kyesi lwenina kyawu, mboti bwakála yuka ni lwahangabwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>Nzonzidibwoku kikuma kya benu boosu. Meni nzayi bana yísola. Kaasi bulungi ni malungila Masonuku mama: "Wuna wubati dya dipha dyama, wumbalukidini". <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Tukidila buthwena bwabu, yiluzimbwadibwa buna khaku dibwa kedi dyambu, ndangu ha dyakwisa bwa, lwakwikila ni "Meni yenina." <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadibwa: wuna wuyambini mutu wuna thumini meni, meni-meni kayambini. Amana wuna wungyambini, wuyambi phi wuna wáthuma.»<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuni ni Yutasi kamúlambula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mth 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mlk 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Yesu buna kázonza bwabuna, mabanza mámuvwalangana lawu, wuzimbudibwa wengele: «Mu kyedika mbati luzimbwala: mosi hana kati dya benu kandámbula.» <verse eid="JHN 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Balonguki bakala ditala bawu yi bawu amana bakala dihyula keti kikuma kya nati kakala zonzila. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Mosi wa balonguki bandi, wuna kakala zola lawu Yesu, yekaminikini hana thulu ya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Simoni Phetelu wumutekudini ndangu kamuhyula Yesu keti kikuma kya nati kakala zonzila bwabuna. <verse eid="JHN 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Hanga mulonguki wuna wuzenzamini hana thulu ya Yesu amana wumuzimbwadini: «Pfumu, nati yandina?» <verse eid="JHN 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Wuna yivúndikila meni-meni kitini kya dipha yi wuna yihékadya.» Yesu wávundika kitini kya dipha, wubongikya amana wuhanikya kwena Yutasi, mwana wa Simoni Sikadyoti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Yutasi, buna kábonga kitini meni kina, hanga Satana wumukotidini. Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Buna wenina bwawu mu kuhanga, hangabwa tswatsu!» <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Keti mosi, hana kati dya babana bákala ku mesa, kázayaku kikuma kina kámuzimbwala bwabuna. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Yutasi, bwosu kakala sweka waba dya mbongu, ndambu ya batu bázaya ni Yesu kakala muzimbwala ni kasumba bima bina bákala byawu mupfunu kikuma kya mukinzi kondilo kenda hana lusadisu kwena baphutu. <verse eid="JHN 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Amana Yutasi wábonga kitini kya dipha mekina, wálubuka phi muna mbala mosi. Phipha kwákala.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutsiku wa pha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Buna kálubuka Yutasi, Yesu wuzimbudini: «Buthwena Mwana wa mutu bamukembisini, Nzambi phi bamukembisini mwena yandi. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>[Yuka ni Nzambi bamukembisa mwena yandi,] Nzambi phi kamúkembisa mwena yandi meni, ka thama ku kamúkembisa. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>Bana bama, bilumbu bya khunda yenina byawu hika yi benu. Lwatsánda, amana bwosu yízimbula kwena Bayuta: kuna mbati kwenda meni, benu lwalendakwoku kwisa, bwabuna phi nzimbudini kwena benu buthwena. <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>Mutsiku wa pha yiluhekini: zolanenu benu yi benu. Bulungi lwazolana phi benu yi benu, bwosu buna yíluzola meni. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Yuka ni lwazolanaka benu yi benu, batu boosu bazáya ni balonguki bama lwenina.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuni ni Phetelu kamúsuwangana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mth 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simoni Phetelu wumuzimbwadini: «Pfumu, wendi kubiki?» Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Wufwaniku wandanda kedi buthwena kuna mbati kwenda, wandánda nana kilumbu.» <verse eid="JHN 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Phetelu wumuzimbwadini: «Pfumu, kikuma kya biki pfwaniku mu kukulandila buthwena? Yilenda mu kuhana luzingu lwama kikuma kya ngeyi!» <verse eid="JHN 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Walenda hana luzingu lwaku kikuma kya meni? Mu kyedika, mbati kuzimbwala: khoku kakókulaku kedi, watsúwangana mbala tatu ni wunzayiku.»<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Nzila yina yisi nata kwena Tata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Yesu wuzimbudi hika kwena balonguki bandi: «Mbundu yenu yivwalanganaku. Kwikilenu mwena Nzambi, khwikilenu phi mwena meni. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Muna nzu ya Tata wama, bizika byalawu byeninamwa; wadi lo, khanibwoku luzimbwala ni yendi luyidikila kizika kimosi. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Amana yuka ni yendi luyidikila kizika, yikwisa vutwakisa mu kulubonga, lwakala ha kabeta ka meni, ndangu hana yikála meni, benu phi lwakala hakana. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Amana luzayi nzila ya kuma kuna mbati kwenda meni.» <verse eid="JHN 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Tomasi wumuzimbwadini: «Pfumu, tuzayiku keti kubiki wubati kwenda. Abweti twalenda zayilaya nzila?» <verse eid="JHN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Meni yenina nzila, kyedika yi luzingu. Ka mutu ku wakwísa kwena Tata konda kuhitila kwena meni. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Honi lwanzaya meni, lwamúzaya phi Tata wama. Tuka lelu lumuzayini amana lumumoni kedi.»<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Fidiphu wumuzimbwadini: «Pfumu, tusongila Tata, amana bwabuna butufwani.» <verse eid="JHN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Thama-thama yina yisi kala yi benu, abweti Fidiphu ngeyi, wisiku nzayila? Wuna wumboni meni, wumoni phi Tata. Abweti ngeyi wufwani kuzimbula: "Tusongila Tata"? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Wubatiku kwikila ni meni yenina mwena Tata, amana Tata kenina mwena meni? Ndinga zina yisi luzimbwala, zisiku tuka kwena meni-meni, kaasi Tata yandi wisi zingila mwena meni, yandi phi wisi lungisa mihangu myandi. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Khwikilenu tangwa yisi luzimbwala ni meni yenina mwena Tata, amana Tata kenina mwena meni. Kondilo kwikilenu ata kikuma kya myawu meni mihangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Mu kyedika yibatibwa luzimbwala: wuna wakwíkila mwena meni, yandi phi kahánga mihangu mina mbati hanga meni. Kahángamya hika mya lawu kuluta mina mbati hanga meni. Kikuma meni yendi kwena Tata. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Amana moosu mana lwalómba mu khumbu ya meni, yisálama, ndangu, muna nzila ya Mwana, bamukembisa Tata. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Yuka ni lwandomba kima mu khumbu yama, meni yisálakya.»<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusidi ni kahítika Kitembu Kyatoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>«Yuka ni lwisi nzola, lwalúnda mitsiku myama. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Meni yilómba kwena Tata ni kaluheka Muhombi wahika, ndangu kakalaka yi benu bilumbu byosu; <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Kitembu kya kyedika wuna balendaku mu kutambula kwena batu ba tsi, kikuma bamumoniku, bamuzayiku phi. Kaasi benu, lumuzayini, kikuma kisi zingila hana kati dya benu amana kakádiki mwena benu. <verse eid="JHN 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>Yilúsisaku batsona; yikwísa hika kwena benu. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Ka thama ku, batu ba tsi bambónaku hika, kaasi benu, lwambóna hika, kikuma meni mbati zinga, benu phi lwazínga. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Muna kilumbu meni kina, lwabákisa ni meni yenina mwena Tata wama bwosu lwenina benu mwena meni amana meni mwena benu.<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>«Wuna wenina yi mitsiku myama, wisimya lunda phi, yandi wuna wisi nzola. Kinga wuna wisi nzola meni, Tata wama phi kamúzola; meni phi yimúzola amana yidímonikisa kwena yandi.»<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Yutasi, heku ni Yutasi sikadyoti, wumuhyudini: «Pfumu, abweti ni wadimonikisa lwesi kwena betu, kaasi kwena batu ba tsi loni?» <verse eid="JHN 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Yuka ni mutu wisi nzola, kalúnda ndinga yama. Tata wama phi kamúzola, amana twakwísa kwena yandi, twazíngila mwena yandi. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Wuna kanzodiku, kisiku lunda phi ndinga zama. Amana ndinga yina lubati yuka yeku ya meni, kaasi ya Tata wuna wáthuma. <verse eid="JHN 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>Yiluzimbwadini bwabuna bwosu yenina yenu hika. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Kaasi Kitembu Kyatoma, Muhombi wuna katúma Tata mu khumbu ya meni, yandi walúlonga moosu, amana kalúyubulula mambu moosu mana yiluzimbwadikini.»<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>«Yilusisidini ngemba; yiluhekini ngemba yama. Meni yiluhekiku mu phila ya batu ba tsi. Luvumukaku mbundu, lubangaku phi. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>Lwáyuka mana yíluzimbwala: "Yendini amana yikwísa kwena benu". Wadi lwanzolaka, wadi lukasangwala mu kuyuka ni yendini kwena Tata, mukuma Tata kenina wambuta kuluta meni. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Buthwena, yiluzimbwadini mambu mana buna khaku kedi malungila; ndangu ha makwisa lungila, lwakwikila. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Yizónzaku hika lawu yi benu, mukuma pfumu wa tsi yayi, wekina kwisa. Keku keti kima kimosi mwena meni; <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>kaasi ndangu batu ba tsi bazaya ni yisi muzola Tata amana yisi hanga mana kátsenda Tata. Telamenu, tukatukenu homa haka!»<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, miti wa vinu wa kyedika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>Yesu wázimbula kwena balonguki bandi: «Yenina miti wa vinu wakyedika, amana Tata wama kenina wuna wisi hela bibundu bya vinu. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Muhandi wosu wuna wakhundakana kwena meni amana wakonda ha kibundu, kisiwa vusa; muhandi wosu wuna wisi ha kibundu, kisiwa sakwadila ndangu waha hika bibundu byalawu. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Benu ba kasemi kedi lwenina, kikuma kya malongi mana yíluheka. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Zingilenu mwena meni, bwosu yenina meni mwena benu. Phila mosi yi muhandi wa vinu, wufwaniku waha kibundu yuka ni weku wadinama ku miti wa vinu; phila mosi phi yi benu, yuka ni luzingidiku mwena meni. <verse eid="JHN 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>Meni yenina miti wa vinu, benu lwenina mihandi. Wuna wisi zingila mwena meni bwosu yenina meni mwena yandi, yandina kaha bibundu byalawu; kinga, konda meni, lwalendaku hanga kima. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Wuna wisiku zingila mwena meni, wakutimbula ku phenza kenina hanga muhandi amana wuyumukini; mihandi myaloka bisimya tonguna, batimbudimya ku mbawu amana milemini. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Yuka ni lwazingilaka mwena meni, yi ndaka zama mwena benu, lwalómba kyosu kina lwazóla amana lwatámbulakya. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Tala buna yisi monikina khembu ya Tata wama: lwabutaka bibundu byalawu amana lwakituka balonguki kikuma kya meni. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Bwosu kánzola Tata, meni phi yíluzola. Zingilakenu mu zola dyama. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Yuka ni lwalundaka mitsiku myama, lwazíngila muna zola dyama, bwosu yílunda meni mitsiku mya Tata wama amana yisi zingila muna zola dyandi.»<verse eid="JHN 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>«Yiluzonzidini bwabuna ndangu kyesi kyama kyakala mwena benu amana kyesi kya benu kyakala kyalungila. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Mutsiku wama wenina wawu: Zolanenu benu yi benu bwosu buna yíluzola meni. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Heku mutu wenina yi zola dina dihitini yuka ni ka wuna ku wuzodi kufwa kikuma kya banduku bandi. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Yuka ni lwalemvukaka mu mana yisi lutuma meni, benu lwenina banduku bama. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Yisiku lutela hika bahika, kikuma muhika kisiku zaya dibanza dya pfumu wandi. Yisi lutela banduku bama, kikuma moosu mana yíyuka kwena Tata wama, yíluzimbwalama benu phi. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Ka benu ku lwátsola meni, kaasi meni yílusola, yíluheka kisalu ndangu lwenda amana lwabuta bibundu byalawu, amana bibundu byenu byananga. Ndangu Tata kaluheka byosu bina lwamúlomba mu khumbu ya meni. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Mutsiku yilusidini, wenina wawu: zolanenu benu yi benu.»<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Batu ba tsi bamumengini Yesu yi balonguki bandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>«Yuka ni batu ba tsi babati lumenga, zayenu ni meni bátekila menga. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Wadi ni lwakalaka batu ba tsi, wadi batu ba tsi bakhani luzola kikuma banduku lwenina. Kikuma kya buna lweku batu ba tsi, kinga yílusola amana yílubula ha kati dya bawu, yihakana batu ba tsi bisi lumengina. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>Yubukenu ndinga yina yiluzimbwadikini: "Muhika kahitiku pfumu wandi." Yuka ni bándyokuna meni, benu phi balúnyokuna; yuka ni bálundama malongi mama, balúndama phi mana ma benu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Mambu mana moosu balúhangama kikuma kya khumbu ya meni, kikuma bawu bamuzayiku wuna wáthuma. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Wadi ni yísaku, yikonda bazonzisa phi, wadi bakhaniku kala yi disumu. Kaasi buthwena, baléndaku mu kusuwangana disumu dya bawu. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Wuna wisi mbenga, kisi mumenga phi Tata wama. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Wadi ni yíhangaku mihangu mina myakonda kedi hangama kwena mutu, hana kati dya bawu, wadi bakhaniku kala yi disumu. Kinga, buthwena bamonimya mihangu myama kaasi batumengi yi meni yi Tata wama. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Kaasi bwabuna buhangamini ndangu ndinga meni yina básonika muna mitsiku mya bawu yalungila: "Bámbenga konda kikuma."<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>«Tangwa kakwísa Muhombi wuna yilúhitika meni, wuna watúka kwena Tata, Kitembu wuna wenina kyedika wuna wátuka kwena Tata, yandi wuna wathíla kimbangi. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Benu phi lwata kimbangi, kikuma hakimosi lwenina yi meni tukidila ku luyandiku.<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>«Yíluzonzila bwabuna, ndangu hakalaku kisinza kya kubwila kikuma kya benu. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Balúkukwasa mu nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta. Tangwa dyakwísa, wosu wuna walúhonda, kabánza ni Nzambi kabati sadila muna mutindu wawuna. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Amana bahánga bwabuna kikuma bázayaku keti Tata keti meni. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Kaasi kima yiluzimbwadini bwabuna ndangu ha dyalungila tangwa meni dyadina, lwalenga yubuka ni yíluzimbwalabwa kedi.»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Muhangu wa Kitembu Kyatoma</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">«Yíluzimbwalamoku kedi tukidila ku luyandiku, kikuma yíkala hakimosi yi benu. <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Buthwena, yekina kwenda kwena wuna wáthuma amana keti mutu mosi hana kati dya benu, kabatiku phyula ni "wendi kubiki?" <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Kaasi buna yiluzimbwadini bwabuna, kiwayi kilubasini muna mbundu. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Kinga ma kyedika kwama mbati luzimbwala: "Bulungi mboti kwena benu, ni meni yenda kwama, kondi loni Muhombi kakwísaku kwena benu. Kaasi yuka ni yenda, yilúhitika yandi. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Tangwa kakwísa yandi, kasóngila kwena batu ba tsi ni báhunana mu mana matadidini masumu, masonga ma Nzambi yi pfundusu. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Mu mambu matadidini disumu, kikuma bisiku kwikila mwena meni. <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>Mu mana matadidini masonga, kikuma meni yendi kwena Tata amana lwambónaku hika»; <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>Mu mana matadidini pfundusu, kikuma pfumu wa tsi yayi bámufundisa kedi.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>«Mambu ma lawu yenina mawu hika ma kuluzimbwala, kaasi lweku kedi yi ngolu za kusimbilama buthwena. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Ha kakwísa Kitembu wa kyedika, kalúnatisa muna kyedika kyosu, mukuma kazónzilaku mu khumbu ya yandi meni, kaasi kazímbula byosu bina kayúka amana kalúsamwana mana makwísa. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Yandi kakhémbisa, kikuma kabónga mana menina kwena meni ndangu kalusamwanama. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Byosu bina kenina byawu Tata, byenina phi kwena meni. Yihana nzimbwadiki ni kabónga mana menina kwena meni ndangu kalusamwanama.»<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiwayi kyabáluka mu kyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>«Ka thama ku lwambónaku hika, amana kunima dya tangwa dyakhunda lwambóna.» <verse eid="JHN 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Ndambu ya balonguki bandi bakala dihyula bawu yi bawu: «Biki byabina kabati tuzimbwala? "Ka thama ku lwambónaku hika, amana kunima lwambóna", amana: "Yendi kwena Tata wama." <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>Amana bakala zimbula: Biki disongidila dya "ka thama ku"? Tuzayimoku mana kabati zonza.» <verse eid="JHN 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Yesu bwosu kázaya ni bazodi bamuhyula kyufu, hanga wubazimbwadini: «Lubati tendanina kikuma kya buna yiluzimbwadini: "Ka thama ku lwambónaku hika, amana phi kunima dya tangwa dyakhunda lwambóna?" <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadini ni lwadíla, lwayánana phi, kaasi batu ba tsi basángwala; benu, mu kiwayi lwakála, kaasi kiwayi kyenu kyabáluka mu kyesi. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Ha kisi buta mukhetu, mu kiwayi kisi kala kikuma tangwa dyandi dya phasi dilungidini; kaasi tangwa kabutini mwana, kisiku yubuka hika misongu mina; kyesi kya lawu kenina kyawu kikuma wubuti mutu ha tsi. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Phila mosi yi benu, buthwena, mu kiwayi lwenina; kaasi yilúmona hika, mbundu zenu zasángwala lawu, amana hakálaku mutu walúnga mu kulukatula kyesi kyenu.<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>«Muna kilumbu meni kyakina, lwaphyúlaku hika kima. Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadini: kina lwalómba kwena Tata mu khumbu ya meni, kalúhekakya. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Yi bwa buthwena bwabu, khaku kedi lumulomba kima mu khumbu ya meni. Lombenu amana lwatámbula, ndangu kyesi kyenu kyakala kyalungila.»<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, munungi wa tsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>«Moosu mana, mu bingana yisima luzimbwala. Tangwa dyakwísa dina yilúzonzilaku hika mu bingana, kaasi dina yilúsamwana wengele mambu mana matadidini Tata. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Muna kilumbu meni kyakina, lwalómba mu khumbu ya meni, amana yiluzimbwadiku ni meni yilómba kwena Tata kikuma kya benu, <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>kikuma, yandi-meni Tata wama kisi luzola, mukuma benu phi lwisi nzola meni, amana lwisi kwikila ni meni kwena Nzambi yítuka. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Kwena Tata yítuka amana yisi ha tsi. Buthwena, mbati katuka ha tsi amana yendi kwena Tata.» <verse eid="JHN 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Balonguki bandi bazimbudini: «Buthwena wekatuzonzila wengele, konda wasadila hika bingana. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Buthwena tuzayi ni mambu moosu wuzayima, amana weku yi mupfunu ni mutu kakuhyula. Yi hana tukwikididi ni kwena Nzambi wátuka.» <verse eid="JHN 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Yesu wubavutwadini: «Buthwena, lukwikidini? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Talenu, tangwa dyakwísa, amana dilungidi kedi, dina lwahúmbalakana, kosu mutu yi nzila yandi, amana lwasala nzukula meni hika. Kaasi yeku meni hika kikuma Tata kenina yi meni. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Yiluzonzidini bwabuna ndangu lwavwa ngemba mwena meni. Kiwayi kya lawu lwamóna ha tsi yayi. Kaasi kalenu yi kikesa! Meni yínungaya tsi!»<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusambidini kikuma kya balonguki bandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Kunima dya kuzonza bwabuna, Yesu wávumbula mesu ku zilu amana wuzimbudini: «A Tata, tangwa dilungidini. Monikisa khembu ya Mwana waku, ndangu Mwana yandi phi kamonikisa khembu ya ngeyi, <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>amana bwosu wámuheka hamu ha thandu ya mutu wosu, kisi hana luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula kwena batu babana wámuheka. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>-Kinga luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula, lwenina ni bakuzaya ngeyi Nzambi mosi wakyedika, yi wuna wátuma ngeyi, Yesu Kidisitu. - <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Meni yímonikisa khembu ya ngeyi hana tsi; ndungisini kisalu kina wáthuma mu kusala. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Amana buthwena bwabu, Tata, pheka khembu yina yíkala yawu ku mesu ma ngeyi hana tsi khaku kedi yihangama. <verse eid="JHN 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>Ngyadikisiya khumbu yaku kwena batu bana wálubula mu tsi amana wábapheka. Bákala batu ba ngeyi amana wábahana kwena meni, bálunda phi ku ndinga yaku. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Buthwena, bazayini ni byosu bina wápheka, kwena ngeyi byátuka. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Mukuma yíbaheka ndaka zina wápheka ngeyi; bátambulaza. Bázayabwa ni kyedika, kwena ngeyi yítuka amana bákwikila ni ngeyi wáthuma.<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>«Kikuma kya bawu mbati lombila meni. Mbatiku lombila kikuma kya batu ba tsi, kaasi kikuma kya babana wápheka, kikuma benina ba ngeyi. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Kyosu kina kyenina kya meni, kya ngeyi kyenina, amana kina kya ngeyi, kyenina phi kya meni; amana mwena bawu yisi monikina khembu yama. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Yenamwoku hika muna tsi, kaasi bawu mu tsi benina; meni yekina mu kukwisa kwena ngeyi. Tata watoma, balema muna khumbu yaku, khumbu yina wápheka, ndangu bákala kima kimosi hanga ngeyi yi meni. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Tangwa khadikini yi bawu, yikala balunda muna ngolu za khumbu yaku, ngolu zina wápheka. Yikala balema amana, hana kati dya bawu, keti mosi kátotaku, katula lwesi wuna wáfwana mu kuditotisa, ndangu Masonuku malungila. <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Buthwena yekina mu kwisa kwena ngeyi. Kima nzonzidini bwabuna buna yenina hika mu tsi, ndangu bavwa mwena bawu-meni kyesi kyama; kyesi kina kyalungila. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Meni yíbaheka ndinga yaku, kaasi batu ba tsi bábamenga kikuma beku bisi tsi yayi, bwosu yeku meni phi wa tsi yayi. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Yikulombiku ni wabakatula ha tsi, kaasi wabalunda ku Mbi. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Beku batu ba ha tsi, bwosu yeku meni phi mutu wa tsi. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Batambika muna kyedika; ndinga yaku yenina kyedika. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Yíbatuma muna tsi bwosu wáthuma ngeyi phi mu tsi. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Amana meni yiditambikini meni wosu kwena ngeyi kikuma kya bawu, ndangu bawu phi bakala ba kutambika kwena ngeyi mu kyedika.<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>«Ndombidiku lwesi kikuma kya bawu, kaasi kikuma phi kya babana bakwíkila mwena meni ku ndinga ya bawu; <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>ndangu boosu bakala kima kimosi, bwosu wenina ngeyi, Tata, mwena meni, yi meni mwena ngeyi, bawu phi bakala mwena betu, ndangu tsi yakwikila ni ngeyi wáthuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Amana meni yibahekini khembu yina wápheka ngeyi, ndangu bakala kima kimosi bwosu thwenina betu kima kimosi. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Meni mwena bawu amana ngeyi mwena meni; ndangu balungila muna kithwadi, amana tsi yazaya ni ngeyi wáthuma, wábazola phi bwosu buna wánzola meni. <verse eid="JHN 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>Tata, bana wábapheka, amana nzodi ni kwosu kuna yenina meni, bawu phi bakala kwakuna hakimosi yi meni ndangu bamona khembu yama, khembu yina wápheka, kikuma watekila nzola hana tsi khaku yihangama. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>Tata wa masonga, tsi yákuzayaku, kaasi meni yíkuzaya, amana baba-baba babakudi ni ngeyi wáthuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Yízayikisaya khumbu yaku kwena bawu amana yibázayikisaya hika, ndangu zola dina wenina dyawu kikuma kya meni, dyakala mwena bawu, hanga meni mwena bawu.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Kukwatama kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mth 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Tangwa kámanisa mu kuzonza bwabuna, Yesu wálubuka yi balonguki bandi ndangu benda ku sambwa dya mwana mamba ma Setoni, kwakuna kwákala yi masamba mamosi; Yesu yi balonguki bandi bákota mwamuna. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Yutasi, wuna wámulambula, wázaya phi homa hahana; kikuma Yesu yi balonguki bandi bakala kwenda kutakaninaka mbala za lawu kwakuna. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Amana Yutasi wisa tula kwakuna, wánata kibuka kya baphumbulu yi batsinzidi bana bámuheka kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi bafwadisi. Bákala yi binwaninu amana basimbiki mwinda mya mbweta yi masoka. <verse eid="JHN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Yesu wázaya mambu moosu makhana mubwila, wábwesuka kuna thwala amana wubazimbwadini: «Nati lubati sanda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Bamuvutwadini: «Yesu mwisi Nazaleti.» Yandi wubazimbwadini: «Meni yandu.» Amana Yutasi, wuna wakhana mulambula, watelama kákala hakimosi yi bawu. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Buna kábazimbwala: «Meni yandu», bávutwakisa kinima-nima amana bábwa ha tsi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Yesu wábahyula hika: «Nati lubati sanda?» Bawu phi bamuvutwadini: «Yesu mwisi Nazaleti.» <verse eid="JHN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Yesu wuvutudini: «Yiluzimbwadikibwa kedi ni meni yandu; amana yuka ni meni lubati sanda, yambulenu baba-baba benda kwabawu.»<verse eid="JHN 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Kázimbula bwabuna ndangu yalungila ndinga yina katekila zonza: «Thotisikiku keti mosi wa babana wápheka.» <verse eid="JHN 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Kinga Simoni Phetelu, mbedi ya phoku kákala yawu, wáholaya, wáhuta kutu dya kitata dya musadi wa mbuta wa banganga Nzambi. Khumbu ya musadi wuna yákala Malukusu. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Yesu wázimbula kwena Phetelu: «Vutula mbedi yaku ya phoku muna kilalu kyandi. Ngeyi wubanzi ni bungu dya phasi dyadi kaphekini Tata ndwadyoku?»<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ku thwala Ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Kibuka kya baphumbulu yi bapfumu ba bawu yi batsinzidi ba Bayuta bámukwatidila Yesu amana bámukasa. <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Hanga bamunatini theti kwena Ana, yandi, buko bwa Khayifu kákala, wuna wákala mbuta wa banganga Nzambi muna mvula meni yayina. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Khayifu meni wuna, yandi wáhana ndongisila yayi kwena Bayuta: «Bulungi ni mutu mosi kafwa kikuma kya kanda dya batu.»<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phetelu wusuwangani ni keku mulonguki wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mth 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mlk 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simoni Phetelu yi mulonguki wahika bakala mulanda Yesu kuna manima. Mulonguki meni wuna wázayasana yi mbuta wa banganga Nzambi, yihakana kákotila nzila mosi yi Yesu muna kati dya kyanzala kya nzu ya mbuta wa banganga Nzambi; <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Phetelu, yandi sadikini hana phenza, bela-bela yi mwelu. Hanga mulonguki wuna wázayakana yi mbuta wa banganga Nzambi wulubukini amana wendi zonza yi tsinzidi wa mukhetu wuna wakala tadikina mwelu, kunima, wámukotisa Phetelu. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Hanga musadi wa mukhetu meni yana wakala tsinzidi ku mwelu wuzimbudi kwena Phetelu: «Ngeyi phi weku mosi wa balonguki ba mutu wuna?» Yandi wumuvutwadini: «Loni, ka meni ku.»<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Basadi yi batsinzidi hana bákala; báwika mbawu amana bekina yeta mukuma kuma kyosi kwákala. Phetelu phi hana kákala yi kuyetaka mbawu hakimosi yi bawu.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuta wa banganga Nzambi wumufundisini Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mth 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mlk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Mbuta wa banganga Nzambi wumuhyudini Yesu mu mambu mana matadidini balonguki bandi yi malongi mandi. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Meni yikala zonza phwelele kwena mutu wosu. Yikala longa kosu tangwa muna nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta yi muna nzu ya Nzambi, muna bisi kutakanina Bayuta boosu. Amana yízonzaku keti kima kimosi mu kitsweki. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Kikuma kya biki wubati phyudila? Mambu mana nzonzini, hyulama kwena batu babana bángyuka; bawu bazayi bukheti mana yízonza meni.» <verse eid="JHN 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Yesu buna kázimbula bwabuna, mosi wa batsinzidi bana bákala hakana, hanga wumuti mbata mu kuzimbula: «Yibwabuna wubati vutula kwena mbuta wa banganga Nzambi?» <verse eid="JHN 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Yuka ni mbi nzonzini, songilaya; kaasi yuka ni bukheti nzonzini, kikuma kya biki wubati mbetila?» <verse eid="JHN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Hanga Ana wumuhitikini, wakukasa, kwena Khayifu, mbuta wa banganga Nzambi.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phetelu wumutuni hika Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mth 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mlk 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Simoni Phetelu hana kákala yi kuyetaka mbawu. Bamuzimbwadini: «Ngeyi phi weku mosi wa balonguki bandi?» Kaasi yandi wátuna mu kuzimbula: «Ka meni ku.» <verse eid="JHN 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Mosi wa basadi ba mbuta wa banganga Nzambi, wuna wákala kiwutu kya mutu wuna káhuta Phetelu kutu, wuzimbudini: «Meni yikumonikiku muna masamba, hakimosi yi yandi?» <verse eid="JHN 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Kaasi Phetelu wátuna hika. Muna tangwa meni dina, khoku wákokula.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ku thwala Philatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mth 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">27:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mlk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Hanga muna suka, bapfumu ba banganga Nzambi bamunatini Yesu tukidila ku nzu ya Khayifu yi kuna nganda ya pfumu wa mbanza wa Loma. Bawu-meni bákotamwoku mu nganda hanga badisumuna nana, ndangu balenga ta mukinzi wa Phaki. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Philatu wálubuka kuna bákala bawu amana wuzimbudini: «Khi dyambu lubati mufundila mutu yandu?» <verse eid="JHN 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Bamuvutwadini: «Wadi ni mutu yandi kákadikiku mutu wambi, wadi tukhaniku kulambwala yandi.» <verse eid="JHN 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Hanga Philatu wubazimbwadini: «Mubongenu benu-benu amana mufundisenu bwosu milombi mitsiku myenu.» Bayuta bamuzimbwadini: «Betu thweku yi muswa wa kuhondisa mutu.»<verse eid="JHN 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Bwáhangama bwabuna ndangu yalungila ndinga yina kázimbula Yesu, mu kusongila phila ya lufwa luna kálunga mu kufwila. <verse eid="JHN 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Philatu wávutuka mu nganda, wámutedisa Yesu amana wumuzimbwadini: «Ngeyi wenina kyamvu wa Bayuta?» <verse eid="JHN 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Yesu wuvutudini: «Dyambu dina wubati phyula, kwena ngeyi-meni ditukini ho batu bahika bakuzimbwadibwa?» <verse eid="JHN 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Philatu wumuhyudini: «Disongidila ni meni Muyuta yenina? Kanda dyaku yi bambuta ba banganga Nzambi bisi kulambula kwena meni; biki wuhangi ngeyi?» <verse eid="JHN 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Yesu wuvutudini: «Luyalu lwama lweku lwa ha tsi yayi. Wadi ni lwákala lwa ha tsi yayi, wadi basadi bama bakhani ndwanina ndangu bandambulaku kwena Bayuta. Mu kuzonza kwamboti, luyalu lwama lweku lwa tsi yayi.» <verse eid="JHN 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Philatu wumuzimbwadini: «Disongidila ni ngeyi kyamvu wenina?» Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Ngeyi-meni wuzonzibwa ni kyamvu yenina. Meni yuka ni yíbutuka, yisa phi mu tsi, ndangu yita kimbangi kwena kyedika. Wosu wuna wenina mu kyedika, kisi yuka ndinga yama.» <verse eid="JHN 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Philatu wumuhyudini: «Biki kyedika?»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu bamuzengidi lufwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mth 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mlk 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Kunima dya kuzimbula bwabuna, Philatu wálubuka hika mu kumona Bayuta amana wubazimbwadini: «Kikuma kya meni, mboniku keti kikuma kimosi kya kumubedisila mukanu mutu yandu. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Bwosu lwáyikana kedi ni kosu mvula, yiluyambwalaka mutu wa boloku mosi mu mukinzi wa Phaki; zengenuti buthwena bwabu, yiluyambwala kyamvu wa Bayuta?» <verse eid="JHN 18:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Hanga boosu bayandikini mu kukalunga: «Ka yandi ku! Kaasi Balabasi!» Kinga, Balabasi ndwandwa kákala.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Hanga Philatu wutumi ni bamubonga Yesu amana bamuzyatula mafimbu. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Baphumbulu bátunga mukhonzi wa tsaku wuna bámuvwatisa kuna mutwa, amana bámuvwatisa muzaka wa kabengi. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Bakala kwisa kwena yandi yi kuzimbulaka: «Mboti, kyamvu wa Bayuta!» Amana bakala muta mbata.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Philatu wálubuka hika amana wázimbula kwena Bayuta: «Yilunatini yandi ku phenza, ndangu lwazaya ni mboniku keti kikuma kimosi, mwena yandi, kya kumubedisila mukanu.» <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Yesu phi wálubuka; wuvwatiki mukhonzi wa tsaku yi muzaka wa kabengi. Amana Philatu wubazimbwadini: «Yandi-wu mutu!» <verse eid="JHN 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi batsinzidi, buna bámumona, hanga bakalungini: «Mukhoka ha kitakani! Mukhoka ha kitakani.» Philatu wubazimbwadini: «Mubongenu benu-benu amana mukhokenu ha kitakani; mukuma meni mboniku kwama kikuma, mwena yandi, kya kumubedisila mukanu.» <verse eid="JHN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Bayuta bamuvutwadini: «Betu thwenina yi mitsiku amana mitsiku meni mina mibati lomba ni kafweti fwa, kikuma wudikitudi Mwana wa Nzambi.» <verse eid="JHN 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Tangwa káyuka Philatu ndinga yina, wáyuka hika bweya lawu. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Wávutuka hika muna nganda amana wáhyula kwena Yesu: «Kubiki wutukini ngeyi?» Kaasi Yesu kámuvutwalaku mvutu. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Hanga Philatu wumuzimbwadini: «Abweti wubatiku ngyakula? Wuzayiku ni meni yenina yi kiyeka kya kukuyambwadila holo kya kukukhokisa ha kitakani?» <verse eid="JHN 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Yesu wuvutudini: «Weku yi kiyeka kimosi hana thandu ya meni yuka ni kakuhekikyoku Nzambi. Ihana ni mutu wuna wisi ndambula kwena ngeyi, disumu dyandi dilutini dina dya ngeyi.»<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Tukidila bwabuna, Philatu kákala sanda phila ya kumusudila Yesu. Kaasi Bayuta bakalungini: «Yuka ni wamusula, weku nduku wa Khayisala. Kosu mutu wuna wudikitudini kyamvu, kipfumu kabati nwanina yi Khayisala!» <verse eid="JHN 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Philatu, buna káyuka mihowu meni mina, hanga wumulubudini Yesu kuna nzila amana yandi wendi zakala hana kiti kyandi kya pfundusu, hana batedini: «Homa bákunga mu matadi, amana mu ndinga ya Bahebelu bisiha tela ni "Ngabata".» <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Kyákala kilumbu kya kuyidika mukinzi wa Phaki, bela-bela yi tsinzi; Philatu wázimbula kwena Bayuta: «Ayanduwu kyamvu wenu!» <verse eid="JHN 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Kaasi bawu bakalungini: «Kafwa! Kafwa! Mukhoka hana kitakani!» Philatu wubahyudini: «Fwani yimukhoka ha kitakani kyamvu wenu?» Bambuta ba banganga Nzambi bamuvutwadini: «Betu thweku yi kyamvu wahika, kaka Khayisala.» <verse eid="JHN 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Hanga wubaheki yandi Yesu ndangu bamukhoka ha kitakani.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu bamukhoki ha kitakani</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mth 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Amana bámunata Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Bwosu kakala nata yandi-meni kitakani kyandi, wálubuka mu hata amana wénda homa hana bisi tela: «Kibelengenzi kya mutwa»; mu ndinga ya Bahebelu, bisiha tela: «Kolukota». <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Hahana bámukhokila ha kitakani. Hakimosi yi yandi, bakhoki hika batu bodi ha kitakani, mosi ku koku dya kitata dya Yesu, mukwawu ku koku dya kimama; yandi bamusi ha kati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Philatu wáyidikisa koma ka dibaya, bánamikadya hana thandu ya kitakani kya Yesu; dyákala dyakusonika: «Yesu mwisi Nazaleti, kyamvu wa Bayuta.» <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Bayuta balawu bakala tanga bisona byabina, kikuma homa hana bámukhokila ha kitakani Yesu hákala bela-bela yi mbanza. Masonuku mana makala mu ndinga tatu: yimosi ndinga ya Bahebelu, yikwawu ndinga ya bisi Loma yi ya Bangeleki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Bambuta ba banganga Nzambi ba Bayuta bázimbula kwena Philatu: «Wusonikaku buna: "Kyamvu wa Bayuta" kaasi sonika: "Mutu yandu kázimbula: Yenina kyamvu wa Bayuta".» <verse eid="JHN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Philatu wuvutudini: «Mana tsonikini, tsonikima kedi.»<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Kunima dya kumukhoka ha kitakani Yesu, baphumbulu bátambula miledi myandi, bákabisamya mu ndambu ya, ndambu mosi-mosi kikuma kya kosu phumbulu. Bátambula hika mvwela yandi yina bakonda nunga mu bitini, kaasi bátungaya yi muledi wamuthu, tukidila ku londi yi kuna banda. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Baphumbulu badizimbwadini bawu yi bawu: «Tuyatayoku mvwela yayi, kaasi tubetilenuyoku zeki ndangu twazaya keti nati watámbulaya.» Bwabuna malungidila Masonuku:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">«Badikabisidini miledi myama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">amana lophu dyama, babetididya zeki<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkg 22:19.</char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Bwabuna báhanga baphumbulu.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Hana kabeta ka kitakani kya Yesu hákala yi ngudi wandi yi phangi wa mukhetu wa ngudi wandi, Madiya mukhetu wa Kolophasi yi Madiya mwisi Makatala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Yesu buna kámona ngudi wandi, amana hana kabeta ka yandi, hákala yi mulonguki wuna kakala zola lawu, hanga wuzimbudi kwena ngudi wandi: «Ngudi, tala mwana waku.» <verse eid="JHN 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Kunima wuzimbudi hika kwena mulonguki: «Tala ngudi waku.» Amana tukidila thangwa meni dyadina, mulonguki wámubonga ku nzu yandi.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mth 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Kunima dya bwabuna, Yesu bwosu kázaya ni moosu malungidi kedi; mu kusya ti Masonuku malungila, wuzimbudini: «Kihwinya yenina kyawu.» <verse eid="JHN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Hákala hakana yi kilekwa kimosi kyákala kyabasa yi vinu dya ngani. Bátambula vuya, bázitikiladya kuna tsongi ya luswaswa lwa Yizophi, bávundikadya muna vinu dya ngani, amana báthutadya yi kuna munwa wandi. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Yesu, buna káfiya vinu dya ngani, wuzimbudini: «Moosu malungidini!» Kunima wázenzika mutwa amana wátabula moyu.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phumbulu mosi wutubudini luhati lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Kilumbu mekina kyákala kitanu, kilumbu kina bakala yidikila sabata amana Bayuta bisa lomba kwena Philatu ndangu bakatula bamvumbi mu bitakani kunima dya kubatolula malu, ndangu mvumbi zinangaku ha kitakani mu kilumbu kya sabata -kikuma kyákala kilumbu kyambuta. - <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Hanga baphumbulu bisini amana batoludini malu ma mutu watheti, kunima ma wuna mukwawu wuna bákhoka ha kitakani yi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Tangwa bátula kwena Yesu, bámona ni wufiki kedi; amana bámutolulaku malu. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Kaasi mosi wa basuta kahanga wumukubi ngumba muna luhati; muna mbala mosi, menga yi mamba málubuka. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Mutu wuna wubati ta kimbangi meni kyakina, yandi wámonakya phi amana kimbangi kyandi kyenina kya kyedika; yandi wuzayi ni kyedika kabati zonza, ndangu benu phi lwakwikila. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Mamana mábwa ndangu Masonuku malungila: «Keti mufufwa wandi wumosi watólukaku.»<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kul 12:46; Thl 9:12; Mkg 34:21.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Amana Mukanda wukwawu wuzimbudini hika: «Batála kwena wuna bátubula<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zkd 12:10.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamuzesi mu mazyamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mth 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Kunima dya bwabuna, Yozefu, mwisi Adimate, wuna wákala mulonguki wa Yesu, kaasi mu kitsweki, kikuma kya bweya bwa Bayuta, wenda lomba nzila kwena Philatu ndangu kakatula lutu lwa Yesu. Philatu wámuheka nzila. Yozefu wisa amana wákatula mvumbi. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Nikodemi, mutu wuna wenda mumona Yesu, kilumbu kimosi muna phipha, wisa nata phi mananasi ma mila ma kubundikisa yi aluwesi, kitesu kya kilo makumatatu. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Yozefu yi Nikundimu bátambula mvumbi ya Yesu amana bávungaya ha muledi, yi mananasi ma tsudi, bwosu bisi zika bamvumbi mu kikalulu kya Bayuta. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Kinga kwákala yi kilanga kimosi kwakuna bámukhokila ha kitakani, amana muna kilanga meni kyakina, mwákala yi mazyamu mamosi mapha bakonda kedi zika keti mutu. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Amana bwosu kyákala kilumbu kya kuyidikila sabata dya Bayuta, mazyamu phi bela-bela mákala, hanga Yozefu yi Nikodemi benda muzesa Yesu muna mazyamu meni mana.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Lufutumuku lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mth 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mlk 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Kilumbu kyatheti kya phosa muna suka-suka, Madiya mwisi Makatala wenda kuna mazyamu, kinga kuma mwa phipha hika kwákala, amana wumoni ni ditadi dyakukatula ku mwelu wa mazyamu. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Wenda thinu katela Simoni Phetelu yi mulonguki mukwawu wuna kakala zola lawu Yesu amana wubazimbwadini: «Pfumu bamukatudini mu mazyamu, tuzayiku phi keti kubiki bamusini.» <verse eid="JHN 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Hanga Phetelu yi mulonguki wuna mukwawu bálubuka ndangu benda kuna mazyamu. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Thinu bakala kwenda bawu bodi; kaasi mulonguki wuna mukwawu thinu za lawu kákala kuluta Phetelu, amana yandi wáditudila theti ku mazyamu. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Kahanga wuzenzamini amana wumonini bitemba bya miledi hana tsi, kaasi kákotaku. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Simoni Phetelu, wakala mulanda ku manima, wisa tula amana wákota muna mazyamu, wumoni bitemba bya miledi hana tsi, <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>yi muledi wuna bámukasa ku mutwa. Muledi meni wuna wákalaku homa hamosi yi bitemba bya miledi; kaasi wákala wakuvunga mu kingenga. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Hanga mulonguki wuna mukwawu wáditudila theti ku mazyamu, wákota yandi phi. Wámona amana wákwikila. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Mukuma yi kuna kilumbu meni kina, balonguki bábakisaku kedi Masonuku mana básonika ni Yesu wáfwana kafutumuka hakati dya bafwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Hanga balonguki bawu bodi bavutuki kwabawu ku nzu.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudisongidi kwena Madiya mwisi Makatala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mth 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mlk 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Madiya wutelamikini kuna phenza, bela-bela yi mazyamu, yi kudilaka. Bwana kakala dila, wuzenzami mu kutala muna mazyamu; <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>hanga wumoni banzyo bodi mu miledi mya phembi, bazakadikini hana hákala theti lutu lwa Yesu, mosi kuna mutwa amana mukwawu kuna malu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Bamuzimbwadini: «Mukhetu, biki wubati didila?» Yandi wubavutwadini: «Kikuma Pfumu wama bamukatudini, nzayiku phi keti kubiki bamusini.» <verse eid="JHN 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Buna kázimbula bwabuna, wábaluka kumanima amana wumoni Yesu wutelamikini, kaasi kázayaku ni Yesu yandina. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Yesu wumuhyudini: «Mukhetu, biki wubati didila? Nati wubati sanda?» Madiya kábanza ni musadi wa bilanga wuna, hanga wumuzimbwadini: «Pfumu, yuka ni ngeyi wumunatini, nzimbwala kuna wumusini, amana yenda mubonga.» <verse eid="JHN 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Madiya!» Yandi wábaluka kwena yandi amana wuzimbudi muna ndinga ya Bahebelu: «Labuni!» disongidila: «Mulongi.» <verse eid="JHN 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Wutsimbaku, mukuma khaku kedi thombuka kwena Tata. Kaasi awenda kwena baphangi bama amana bazimbwala ni thombuki kwena Tata wama wuna wenina phi Tata wenu, Nzambi wama yi Nzambi wenu.» <verse eid="JHN 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Madiya mwisi Makatala wendi samuna kwena balonguki: «Yimumonini Pfumu!» Amana wábamenikina mamana kámuzimbwala.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudisongidi kwena balonguki bandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mth 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Muna masikidika mamana ma kilumbu kyatheti kya phosa, balonguki bákala bawongama muna nzu. Bábindika mwelu yi tsabi, kikuma kya bweya bwa Bayuta. Yesu wisa, hanga wutelami hana kati dya bawu, wubazimbwadini: «Ngemba yakala yi benu!» <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Buna kázimbula bwabuna, wábasongila moku mandi yi luhati lwandi. Balonguki bákala mu kyesi kya lawu mu kumona Pfumu. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Yesu wubazimbwadi hika: «Ngemba yakala yi benu! Bwosu buna káthuma Tata, meni phi yilutumini.» <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Kunima dya kuzimbula bwabuna, wáfula lwanda hana thandu ya bawu amana wubazimbwadini: «Tambulenu Kitembu Kyatoma! <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Kwena bana lwálolula masumu ma bawu, bátambula ndoluka; kwena bana lwakonda lolula, balólukaku.»<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Tangwa kisa Yesu, mosi wa bawu kumi yi bodi, khumbu yandi Tomasi, wuna bisi tela ni diphasa, kákalahoku. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Hanga balonguki bahika bamuzimbwadini: «Tumumoni Pfumu.» Kaasi yandi wubavutwadini: «Yuka ni mboniku bidimbu bina bamukhokidikini tsosu muna moku mandi, yuka ni khotisiku mulembu wama muna bidimbu meni bina, yuka ni khotisiku phi koku dyama muna luhati lwandi, yikwíkilabwoku keti bweti.»<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Kunima dya bilumbu nana, balonguki bandi bákala hika badiphatila muna nzu, Tomasi phi hana kákala hakimosi yi bawu. Mwelu myosu mya kukangisa, hanga Yesu wisi telama hana kati dya bawu, wubazimbwadini: «Ngemba yakala yi benu!» <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Kunima wuzimbudini kwena Tomasi: «Kotisa haha mulembu waku, tala phi moku mama; thuta koku dyaku amana syadya muna luhati lwama. Yambula phaka, kwikila!» <verse eid="JHN 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Tomasi wumuvutwadini: «Pfumu wama yi Nzambi wama!» <verse eid="JHN 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Kikuma wumboni, yihana wukwikididi? Kyesi kwena babana bisi kwikila konda kumona!»<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikuma kya mukanda wawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Yesu wata hika bidimbu bya biphadi byalawu, ku thwala ya balonguki bandi, bina bakonda sonika mu mukanda wawu. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Kaasi byabi básonikabya ndangu lwakwikila ni Yesu kenina Kidisitu, Mwana wa Nzambi, amana muna lukwikilu meni luna, lwatambula luzingu mu khumbu ya yandi.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudimonikisi kwena balonguki bandi tsambwadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Kunima dya ndambu ya bilumbu, Yesu wádimokisa hika kwena balonguki, kuna yanga dya mbuta dya Tibediyadi. Tala buna kádimonikisina: <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simoni Phetelu, Tomasi wuna bisi tela ni diphasa, Natanayedi mwisi mbanza ya Kana, kuna kinzunga kya Ngadidi, bana ba Zebeteya yi balonguki bahika bodi muna kati dya balonguki bandi, boosu bákala homa hamosi. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simoni Phetelu wubazimbwadini: «Yendi loba.» Bawu phi bamuzimbwadini: «Betu phi twakwénda yi ngeyi.» Bálubuka amana bákota mu masuwa. Phipha meni yina yosu bákwataku keti kima. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Kuma buna kwákhya, Yesu hana sambwa kákala watelama; kaasi balonguki bákalaku zaya ni yandi wuna Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Bana bama, tsema lukwatini?» Bawu bamuvutwadini: «Loni», <verse eid="JHN 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>Yandi wubazimbwadini: «Timbulenu wanda kuna koku dya kitata kya masuwa amana lwakwáta.» Bátimbuladya phi, amana bálendaku mu kuthutadya kikuma dyábasa yi batsema balawu. <verse eid="JHN 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Hanga mulonguki wuna kakala zola lawu Yesu, wuzimbudini kwena Phetelu: «Wuna, Pfumu!» Simoni Phetelu buna káyuka: «Pfumu wuna!» wákasa muledi wandi muna mbunda, mukuma kikhonga kákala, amana wáditimbula muna yanga dya mbuta. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Balonguki bahika bisa yi masuwa, kuna yi kukokaka wanda dyakabasi yi batsema, mukuma bákalaku kyana yi mafu, kitesu kya metele khama. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Buna bátula ku tseki, báwana mbawu yi batsema hana ziku, yi dipha. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Natenu ndambu ya batsema babana lukwatini.» <verse eid="JHN 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simoni Phetelu, wázanza muna masuwa amana wákoka yi kuna tseki, wanda dyakabasi yi batsema ba mbuta-mbuta: kitesu kya khama mosi yi makumatanu yi tatu. Mbatanana bákala batsema lawu, wanda dyáyatukaku. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Alwisa dya.» Keti mulonguki wandi mosi kálendaku mu kumuhyula: «Nati wenina ngeyi?», Mukuma bakala zaya ni wuna Pfumu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Yesu wábwesuka, wátambula dipha amana wábahekadya; wábaheka hika phi tsema. <verse eid="JHN 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Yayina yákala mbala ya tatu, Yesu wáfutumuka ku bafwa mu kudimonikisa kwena balonguki bandi.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi Phetelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Buna bámanisa kudya, Yesu wázimbula kwena Simoni Phetelu: «Simoni, mwana wa Yowani, keti lungongu lwa meni wenina lwawu kuluta baba?» Phetelu wumuvutwadini: «Yibwana, Pfumu, wuzayi bukheti ni yisi kuzola.» Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Disa bana bama ba mikoku.» <verse eid="JHN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Wumuzimbwadi hika mu mbala ya zodi: «Simoni, mwana wa Yowani, ngeyi lungongu lwa meni wenina lwawu?» Yandi wumuvutwadini: «Yibwana Pfumu, wuzayi ni yisi kutya.» Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Kala muhungudi wa mikoku myama.» <verse eid="JHN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Wumuzimbwadi hika mu mbala ya tatu: «Simoni, mwana wa Yowani, keti wisi thya meni?» Phetelu wáyuka kyadi kikuma kya buna kámuhyula mu mbala ya tatu: «Keti wisi thya meni?» Yandi wumuvutwadini: «Yibwana Pfumu, wuzayi moosu! Wuzayi phi ni yisi kuzola.» Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Disa mikoku myama. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Mu kyedika yikuzimbwadibwa: tangwa wákala sanda, wakala dikasa ngeyi meni tsibu yaku, amana wakala kwenda kwosu wakala zola; kaasi tangwa wanúna, wayála moku, mutu wahika wakúzika tsibu yaku mu kukunata kuna wuzodiku.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Yesu kázimbula bwabuna mu kusongila mutindu wa lufwa luna káfwila Phetelu kikuma kya kuhana khembu kwena Nzambi. Kunima dya kuzonza bwabuna, Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Ndanda!»<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi mulonguki wuna kakala zola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Phetelu buna kábaluka, wumoni mulonguki wuna kakala zola Yesu, kakala balanda, wuna wáyekamina ha thulu ya Yesu tangwa bákala ku mesa, wámuhyula phi: «Pfumu, nati yanduna wukulambuni?» <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Phetelu buna kámumona, wuzimbudi kwena Yesu: «Pfumu, yandu biki byamúbwila?» <verse eid="JHN 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Yuka yizola ni kazinga tii yikuna yikwísila, makutadini? Ngeyi landa meni!» <verse eid="JHN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Amana musamu wáyalangana ha kati dya baphangi ni mulonguki wuna kafwáku. Kinga Yesu kámuzimbwalaku: «Yandi kafwáku», kaasi kázimbula: «Yuka yizola ni kazinga tii yikuna yikwísila, makutadini?»<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Yandi wuna mulonguki meni wuna wubati ta kimbangi kya mambu mana, yandi wásonikama, amana tuzayi ni kimbangi kyandi kyenina kyedika.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu kumanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Henina hika yi mambu makwawu ma mbuta káhanga Yesu. Wadi ni básonikakama dimosi-dimosi, mbanzi ni yameni tsi yosu yakhanaku lungila mu mikanda mina bakhana sonika.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
